<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Aromanian Frasherot</book>
  <para style="h">Ioan</para>
  <para style="toc1">Evanghelu Dupã Ioan</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ioan</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ioan</para>
  <para style="mt1">Evanghelu Dupã Ioan</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s1">Zborlu s-Featsi Trup</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Tu apãrnjitã eara Zborlu, shi Zborlu eara cu Dumnidzãlu, shi Zborlu eara Dumnidzãlu. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Zborlu eara tu apãrnjitã cu Dumnidzãlu. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Tuti lucrili s-featsirã prit nãsu shi fãrã di nãsu nu s-featsi tsiva di tuti tsi s-featsirã. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />La nãsu eara bana sh-bana eara lunjinã trã oaminjlji. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Lunjina lunjineadzã tu scutidi shi scutidlu nu u azvimsi. <verse eid="JHN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Dumnidzãlu pitricu un om cu numa Ioan. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Elu vini ca martir s-mãrtirsea di lunjina, tsi tuts s-pistipsea prit nãsu. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Elu nu eara lunjina, ma s-pitricu tra s-mãrtirsea di lunjina. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Zborlu eara lunjina alihioasã, tsi lunjineadzã cathi om tsi yini tu lumi. <verse eid="JHN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Zborlu eara tu lumi sh-lumea s-adrã prit nãsu, ma lumea nu lu cunuscu. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Zborlu vini la oaminjlji a lui sh-atselji a lui nu lu apruchearã. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Ma a tuts atsilor tsi lu apruchearã sh-atsilor tsi pistipsirã tu numa a lui, elu lã deadi puteari tra si s-facã hiljilji a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Elji nu s-amintarã nitsi di sãndzili, nitsi di vrearea a truplui, nitsi di vrearea a bãrbatlui, ma suntu amintatã di la Dumnidzãlu. <verse eid="JHN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Zborlu s-featsi trup sh-bãnã namisa di noi mplin di har sh-di alihea. Noi vidzum mãrirea a lui, ca mãrirea a Hiljilui singur-amintat di la Talãl. <verse eid="JHN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Ioanul mãrtirsi trã nãsu sh-grãi dzãcãnda: “Aestu easti atsel di cai vã am aspusã: ‘Atsel tsi yini dupã mini easti ma mari di mini cã eara nãinti di mini.’” <verse eid="JHN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Noi tuts lom di mplinãtatea a lui har pristi har. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Cã Legea s-deadi prit Moisiul, harul sh-alihea vinirã prit Isus Hristolu. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Vãrã nu lu vidzu Dumnidzãlu vãrãoarã, mash Hiljilu singur-amintat, tsi easti Dumnidzã tu sinul a Tatãlui, tsi elu lu featsi cunuscut.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ioan Pãtidzãtorlu Nu Easti Hristolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Atumtsea, mãrlji a Iudeilor dit Ierusalem lji pitricurã preftsãlji shi Levitslji sh-lu ntribarã: “Cai eshti tini?” Aestã eara mãrtiria a Ioanului. <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Elu nu lu alipidã, ma apãndisi sh-mãrtirisi: “Mini nu escu Hristolu.” <verse eid="JHN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Shi elji lu ntribarã: “Atumtsea cai eshti? Eshti tini Elia?”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:21">Elu dzãsi: “Nu escu mini!”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:21">“Eshti tini Prufitlu?”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:21">Elu apãndisi: “Nu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Atumtsea elji lj-dzãsirã: “Cai eshti tini? Dzã-nã s-lã dãm unã apandisi atsilor tsi nã pitricurã. Tsi dzãtsi tini trã tini?” <verse eid="JHN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Ioanul dzãsi: “Mini escu boatsea atsilui tsi greashti tu irnjii: ‘Ndriptats-u calea a Domnului’, ashã cum dzãsi prufitlu Isaia.” <verse eid="JHN 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Atselji tsi eara pitricuts, eara di Fariseilji, <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />sh-lu ntribarã: “Atumtsea cãtse pãtedz, cãndu nu eshti Hristolu, nitsi Elia, nitsi Prufitlu?” <verse eid="JHN 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Ioanul lã-apãndisi a lor: “Mini pãtedz cu apã, ma namisa di voi easti unu, tsi nu lu cunushtets. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Elu easti atsel, tsi yini dupã mini shi atsilui mini nu escu axiu nitsi s-lji dizlegã ligãturili a sandalilor.” <verse eid="JHN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Aesti lucri undzirã tu Betania, napãrti di Iordan, iu Ioanul ma pãtidza.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ioanul Mãrtirseashti ti Isusul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Alantã dzuã, Ioanul lu vidzu Isusul tsi ma yinea cãtrã nãsu sh-dzãsi: “Ia, Njelu a Dumnidzãlui, tsi ljea amãrtiili a lumiljei! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Elu easti atsel di cai mini dzãsh: ‘Dupã mini yini un om tsi easti ma mari di mini, cã elu eara ma nãinti di mini!’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Mini nu lu cunushteam, trã atsea vinj tsi s-pãtedz tu apã, tsi elu s-aspunã tu Israel.” <verse eid="JHN 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Shi Ioanul mãrtirisi dzãcãnda: “Lu vidzui Duhlu dipunãnda dit tser ca un purumbu tsi stãtu pri nãsu. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Mini nu lu cunushteam, ma atsel tsi mi pitricu tsi s-lu pãtedz tu apã, nji-dzãsi: ‘Pristi atsel pri cai va s-vedz tsi s-dipunã Duhlu sh-va armãnã pristi nãsu, elu easti tsi pãteadzi cu Duhlu Sãmtu.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Mini vidzui sh-mãrtirsi cã aestu easti Hiljilu a Dumnidzãlui.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ucenitsilji al Ioan Pãtidzãtorlu Urmeadzã Isusul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Alantã dzuã, Ioanul stãtea nãpoi aclo cu doi di ucenitsilji a lui. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Sh-cãndu lji arcã ocljilji pri Isusul, tsi ma imna, dzãsi: “Ia, Njelu a Dumnidzãlui.” <verse eid="JHN 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Doi ucenitsilji avdzãrã atsel tsi ma grea sh-lu urmarã Isusul. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Atumtsea Isusul s-turnã sh-cãndu vidzu tsi ma lu urma, lã dzãsi a lor: “Tsi cãftats?” Sh-elji dzãsirã: “Rabbi” (tsi tradus va s-dzãcã Nvitsãtor) “iu stai?” <verse eid="JHN 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Elu lã dzãsi a lor: “Haidets shi videts.” Vinirã sh-vidzurã iu stãtea elu, shi shidzurã atsea dzuã deadun cu nãsu. Eara oara patru dupã prãndzu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">easti a dzatsea oarã dupã Iudei</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Andrea, fratili al Simon Petru, eara un di atselji doilji tsi lu avdzãrã di la Ioanul aestã sh-lu urmarã Isusul. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Elu lu aflã prota fratili a lui, Simonul shi lj-dzãsi: “Lu aflãm Mesia!” (tsi tradus va s-dzãcã: Hristos). <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Sh-lu adusi la Isusul. Atumtsea Isusul lu vidzu sh-lji dzãsi: “Tini eshti Simonul, hiljilu al Ioan. Tini va s-hii acljimat Chefa” (tsi tradus va s-dzãcã cheatrã).<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Acljimarea al Filip sh-Natanael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Alantã dzuã, Isusul vrea s-dutsea tu Galilea. Aflã Filipul sh-lji dzãsi: “Urmeadzã-mi!” <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Filipul eara di Betsaida, di cãsãbãlu al Andrea sh-a Petrului. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Filipul aflã Natanaelul sh-lji-dzãsi: “Lu aflãm atsel, di cai ari scriatã Moisiul tu Lege sh-Prufitsilji tutashã: Isusul di Nazaret, hiljilu al Iosif!” <verse eid="JHN 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Natanaelul ntribã: “Poati s-easã tsiva bunã di Nazaretul?” Filipul lji dzãsi: “Haidi s-vedz!” <verse eid="JHN 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Isusul vidzu Natanaelul tsi ma yinea cãtrã nãsu sh-lji dzãsi: “Ia, un Israelit alihios, la cai nu ari arãdeari.” <verse eid="JHN 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Natanaelul lji dzãsi: “Di iu mi cunoshti?” Isusul lji-apãndisi: “Ti vidzui cãndu earai sum pomlu a hiclui, nãinti tsi s-ti acljima Filipul.” <verse eid="JHN 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Natanaelu apãndisinda dzãsi: “Rabbi, tini eshti Hiljilu a Dumnidzãlui, tini eshti amirãlu al Israel!” <verse eid="JHN 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Isusul lj-apãndisi: “Cã ts-dzãshu cã ti vidzui sum hic, tini pistipseashti, va s-vedz lucri ma mãri di aesti!” <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Deapoea lji-dzãsi: “Dealihea ma vã dzãc: voi va s-videts tserlu discljis sh-anghilji a Dumnidzãlui alinãnda shi dipunãnda pristi Hiljilu a Omlui.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:12">Ahr 28:12</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s1">Isusul Alãxi Apa tu Yin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Sh-tu dzua a treia s-featsi unã numtã tu Cana a Galileiljei, shi muma al Isus eara aclo. <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Isusul cu ucenitsilji a lui eara acljimat la numtã. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Cum bitisi yinlu, muma al Isus lji dzãsi a lui: “Elji nu au ma yin.” <verse eid="JHN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Isusul lji-dzãsi: “Ts-ai cu mini, muljeari? Oara a mea nu ari vinitã ninga.” <verse eid="JHN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Muma a lui lã dzãsi a huzmichearilor: “Fãtsets itsido tsi elu vã dzãtsi!” <verse eid="JHN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Shi aclo eara bãgati shasi vasi di cheatrã, tsi s-ufilisea trã curarea a Iudeilor, shi cathiun ncãpea cãti optudzãts pãnã unã sutã shi yinghits di litri. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Isusul lã dzãsi: “Umplets vasili cu apã.” Sh-elji li umplurã pãnã nsus. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Deapoea lã dzãsi: “Scutets tora sh-dutsets-lji a protlui a sãrbãtoariljei.” Sh-elji lji dusirã. <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Protlu a sãrbãtoariljei u-bãgã n-gurã apa adratã tu yin, elu nu shtia cã di iu yinea yinlu, ma shtia huzmichearlji tsi u-avea scoasã apa. Atumtsea protlu a sãrbãtoariljei acljimã dzinirli, <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />shi lj-dzãsi: “Cathi om scoati ma nãinti yinlu atsel bunlu, shi cãndu acljimatslji au biutã ghini, scoati yinlu atsel-slablu, tini fãtseshi aljumtrea, lu ai tsinutã yinlu atsel-bunlu pãnã tora.” <verse eid="JHN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Isusul featsi aestã apãrnjitã a seamnilor tu Cana a Galileiljei shi aspusi mãrirea a lui, shi ucenitsilji a lui pistipsirã la nãsu. <verse eid="JHN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Dupã aestã, dipunã tu Capernaum elu sh-muma a lui, fratslji a lui shi ucenitsilji a lui, sh-armasirã aclo di putsãni dzãli.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Curã Locurili a Templui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Pashtili a Iudeilor eara aproapi sh-Isusul s-alinã tu Ierusalem. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Elu aflã tu templu atselji tsi vindea boi, oi sh-purunghi sh-alãxitori di pãradz shãdzãnda. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Cum adrã unã cãmgicã di funi, lji avinã tuts dit templu deadun cu oili, boilji, sh-li scurpisi pãradzlji a alãxitorilor sh-arãsturnã measili, <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />sh-atsilor tsi vindea purunghi lã dzãsi: “Loats-li aesti lucri di aoa! Nu u fãtsets casa a Tatãlui a meu ca casã di prãmãteftsã!” <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Ashãtsi ucenitsilji a lui adusirã aminti cã eara scriatã: “Zelu di casa a ta mi ardi ca foc!”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">Ps 69:9</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Atumtsea Iudeilji lji dzãsirã: “Tsi semnu nã aspunji cã ai autoritati s-li fats aesti lucri?” <verse eid="JHN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Isusul lã apãndisi a lor: “Aspãrdzets-lu aestu templu sh-di trei dzãli mini va lu adarã nãpoi!” <verse eid="JHN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Atumtsea Iudeilji dzãsirã: “S-hãrzãirã patrudzãtsi shi-shasi di anji si s-adarã aestu templu, sh-tini va lu adari di trei dzãli?” <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Ma elu zbura di templu a truplui a lui. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Cãndu, ma nãpoi elu s-nyie dit mortsã, ucenitsilji a lui adusirã aminti cã elu aestã lã-u avea dzãsã sh-pistipsirã la Scritura shi la zborlu tsi avea dzãsã Isusul. <verse eid="JHN 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Cãndu eara tu Ierusalem la sãrbãtoarea a Pashtiljei, multsã pistipsirã tu numa a lui vidzãnda thavmatili tsi fãtsea. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Ma Isusul nu pistipsea la elji, cã elu lji cunushtea tuts. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Elu nu avea ananghi tsi vãrã s-lji mãrtirsea di omlu, cã elu shtia tsi eara nãuntru a omlui.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Isusul Nveatsi Nicodemul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Namisa di Fariseilji eara un om cu numa Nicodem, un di mãrlji a Iudeilor. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Aestu vini noaptea la Isusul shi-lji dzãsi: “Rabbi, noi lu shtim cã tini eshti nvitsãtor vinit di la Dumnidzãlu, cã vãrã nu poati s-facã seamnili tsi fats tini, macã Dumnidzãlu nu easti cu nãsu.” <verse eid="JHN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Isusul lji-apãndisi: “Dealihea ma tsã dzãc, cã macã vãrã nu va si s-amintã nãpoi, elu nu poati s-u veadã amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui.” <verse eid="JHN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nicodemul lu-ntribã: “Cum poati si s-amintã un om cãndu easti aush? Poati s-intrã elu di a doaua oarã tu pãnticlu a mumãljei shi si s-amintã?” <verse eid="JHN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Isusul lji-apãndisi: “Dealihea ma tsã dzãc cã, cai nu s-amintã dit apã sh-di la Duhlu, nu poati s-intrã tu amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Tsi easti amintat di trup easti trup, sh-tsi easti amintat di la Duhlu easti duh. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Nu ti ciudisea cã tsã-dzãsh: ‘Voi prindi s-vã amintats nãpoi.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Vimtul suflã iu va, sh-tini lji avdzã boatsea, ma nu shtii di iu yini shi cãtrã iu neadzi. Ashã easti cu caitsido tsi easti amintat di la Duhlu.” <verse eid="JHN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nicodemul lu ntribã: “Cum poati s-undzeascã aesti lucri?” <verse eid="JHN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Isusul lj-apãndisi: “Tini eshti nvitsãtor tu Israel shi nu li shtii aesti lucri? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Dealihea ma tsã dzãc. Noi zburãm atsea tsi shtim, shi mãrtirsim atsea tsi avem vidzut, ma voi nu u aprucheats mãrtiria a noastrã. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Macã vã am grãit di lucrili a loclui sh-voi nu pistipsits, cum va pistipsits macã vã grescu di lucrili tsereshti? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Vãrã nu s-alinã tu tser, di cãt mash atsel tsi dipunã dit tser, Hiljilu a Omlui. <verse eid="JHN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Sh-ashã cum Moisiul u alinã nãpãrtica tu irnjii, ashãtsi prindi si s-analtsã nsus Hiljilu a Omlui, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />cã caitsido tsi pistipseashti la elu, s-aibã banã eternã. <verse eid="JHN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Cã Dumnidzãlu u vru ahãntu multu lumea, cãt deadi Hiljilu a lui singur-amintat, tsi caitsido tsi pistipseashti tu nãsu nu va s-chearã, ma va aibã banã eternã. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Cã Dumnidzãlu nu lu pitricu Hiljilu a lui tu lumi tra s-giudicã lumea, ma tsi lumea s-ascapã prit nãsu. <verse eid="JHN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Atsel tsi pistipseashti tu nãsu, nu s-giudicã, ma atsel tsi nu pistipseashti, tora easti giudicat, cã nu ari pistipsitã tu numa a Hiljilui singur-amintat a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Ma giudicata easti aestã: Lunjina vini tu lumi, ma oaminjlji vrurã scutidlu ma multu dicãt lunjina, cã faptili a lor eara anapudi. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Cã caitsido tsi fatsi lucri arali aurãshti lunjina sh-nu yini la lunjina, tra s-nu s-aspunã faptili a lui. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Ma cai fatsi alihea yini la lunjinã, tsi faptili a lui s-aspunã, cã suntu adrati tu Dumnidzãlu.”<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ioan Pãtidzãtorlu Mãrtirseashti Nãpoi trã Isusul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Dupã atsea, Isusul vini cu ucenitsilji a lui tu loclu a Iudeiljei shi stãtu atsia deadun cu nãshi sh-pãtidza. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Ma sh-Ioanul pãtidza la Enon, aproapi di Salim, cã aclo avea multã apã, shi oaminjlji yinea shi s-pãtidza. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Atumtsea, Ioanul nu eara hãpsãnit ninga. <verse eid="JHN 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Deapoea s-apãrnji unã niachicãsiri namisa di ucenitsilji al Ioan sh-a unui Iudeu trã curarea. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Sh-vinirã la Ioanul sh-lji dzãsirã: “Rabbi, atsel tsi eara cu tini napãrti di Iordan, trã cai tini ai mãrtirsitã, ia, elu pãteadzã, sh-tuts yinã la elu.” <verse eid="JHN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Ioanul lj-apãndisi: “Un om nu poati s-ljea tsiva, macã nu lji-si easti datã dit tser. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Voi idyilji hits martiri cãndu dzãsh: ‘Mini nu escu Hristolu, ma escu pitricut nãintea a lui.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Atsel tsi ari nveasta easti dzinirli, ma oaspili a dzinirlui tsi lji-sta aproapi shi avdi, s-hãrseashti multu di boatsea a dzinirlui. Trã atsea haraua a mea easti mplinitã. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Elu prindi s-creascã, iarã mini s-mi njicuredz. <verse eid="JHN 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />Atsel tsi yini di nsus easti pristi tuts. Atsel tsi yini dit loc, dit loc easti sh-di loc greashti. Atsel tsi yini dit tser easti pristi tuts. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Sh-mãrtirseashti ti atsea tsi ari vidzutã sh-avdzãtã, ma vãrã nu u aproachi mãrtiria a lui. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Atsel tsi u-apruche mãrtiria a lui, u-vulusi cã Dumnidzãlu easti alihios. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Cã atsel tsi Dumnidzãlu ari pitricut, greashti zboarili a Dumnidzãlui, cã Dumnidzãlu nu lu da Duhlu fãrã mizurã. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Tatãl lu va Hiljilu sh-tuti lji-li deadi tu mãnã. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Atsel tsi pistipseashti tu Hiljilu ari banã eternã, ma atsel tsi arniseashti s-ascultã Hiljilu nu va veadã banã, ma nãrirea a Dumnidzãlui armãni pri nãsu.”<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Isusul Greashti cu Muljearea Samariteanã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Cãndu Isusul aduchi cã Fariseilji avdzãrã cã elu ma fãtsea ma multsã ucenitsi sh-ma pãtidza ma multsã di Ioanul, <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />(cu tutã cã nu li pãtidza Isusul, ma ucenitsilji a lui), <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />apãrãtsi Iudea sh-fudzi nãpoi tu Galilea. <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Ma prindea s-tritsea prit Samaria. <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Agiumsi la un cãsãbã a Samariiljei tsi s-acljima Sihar, aproapi di loclu iu Iacovul lji-avea datã al Iosif, hiljilu a lui. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Aclo eara putslu al Iacov. Sh-Isusul acurmat di cali, shidzu ningã putslu. Eara njeadzãdzuã.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eara a shasea oarã dupã Iudeilji</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Unã muljeari di Samaria vini si s-scutea apã. Isusul lji dzãsi: “Dã-nji s-beau!” <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Ucenitsilji a lui si-avea dusã tu cãsãbã s-acumpãra trã mãcari. <verse eid="JHN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Atumtsea muljearea Samariteanã lji dzãsi: “Ma cum, tini tsi eshti Iudeu caftsã s-beai di la mini, tsi escu unã muljeari Samariteanã?” (Cã Iudeilji nu s-mistica cu Samaritenjilji). <verse eid="JHN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Isusul lj-apãndisi: “Ma s-u shtiai tini doara a Dumnidzãlui sh-cai easti atsel tsi ts-dzãtsi: ‘Dã-nji s-beau’, tini idyia va cãftai di la nãsu sh-elu va tsã dãdea apã yii.” <verse eid="JHN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Muljearea lji-dzãsi: “Doamne, tini nitsi stamnã nu ai sh-putslu easti hãndosu, iu va-u aflã apa atsea yiea? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Vahi eshti ma mari dicãt Iacovul, ntãnjiu a nostru, tsi nã deadi aestu puts shi biu di la nãsu elu idyiul, hiljilji a lui sh-prãvdzãli a lui?” <verse eid="JHN 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Isusul lji-apãndisi: “Caitsido tsi bea di aestã apã, va aibã napoi seati. <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />Ma cai bea di atsea apã, tsi va lji dau mini, nu va-aibã pute seati. Sh-apa, tsi mini va lji dau, va s-facã tu nãsu un izvur di apã tsi va lji da tu eta di totãna.” <verse eid="JHN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Atumtsea muljearea lji-dzãsi: “Doamne, dã-nji aestã apã, tsi s-nu nji hibã ma seati shi s-nu yinã ma aoa si scot apã.” <verse eid="JHN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Isusul lji-dzãsi: “Duti, grea a bãrbatlui a tãu shi haidi aoa!” <verse eid="JHN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Muljearea lj-apãndisi: “Mini nu am bãrbat.” Isusul lji-dzãsi: “Ghini dzãtseshi: ‘Nu am bãrbat.’ <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Tini avush tsintsi bãrbats sh-atsel tsi ai tora nu easti bãrbatlu a tãu. Tu aestã ai aspusã alihea.” <verse eid="JHN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Muljearea lji-dzãsi: “Doamne, ma ved cã tini eshti prufit. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Pãrintsãlji a noshtri si ncljina pri aestu munti, ma voi Iudei dzãtsets cã Ierusalemlu easti loclu iu prindi s-nã ncljinãm.” <verse eid="JHN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Isusul dzãsi: “Muljeari, pistipsea-mi: yini oara tsi nitsi pri aestu munti, nitsi tu Ierusalem nu va-alãvdats Tatãl. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Voi Samaritenji alãvdats atsel tsi nu lu cunushtets. Noi alãvdãm atsel tsi cunushtem, cã ascãparea yini di Iudeilji. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Ma yini oara, sh-tora ari vinitã, tsi ncljinãtorlji alihioshi va si ncljinã la Tatãl tu Duh sh-tu alihea, cã ahtãri ncljinãtori va Tatãl. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Dumnidzãlu easti duh, sh-atselji tsi lji-si ncljinã prindi s-lji si ncljinã tu Duh sh-tu alihea.” <verse eid="JHN 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Muljearea lji-dzãsi: “Mini shtiu cã va yinã Mesia” (acljimat Hristos). “Cãndu va yinã elu, va nã-li aspunã tuti.” <verse eid="JHN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Isusul lji-dzãsi: “Mini escu atsel, tsi ma s-greashti!”<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ucenitsilji s-Turnarã Nãpoi la Isusul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Tu aestã oarã vinirã ucenitsilji a lui sh-si s-ciudisirã tsi ma zbura cu unã muljeari. Ma vãrã nu-lji dzãsi: “Tsi caftsi?”, icã: “Cãtse ma zburashti cu ea?” <verse eid="JHN 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Atumtsea muljearea alãsã stamna a ljei s-dusi tu cãsãbã sh-lã dzãsi a oaminjlor: <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />“Haidets, videts un om tsi nji-ari dzãsã itsido tsi am faptã. Nacã aestu easti Hristolu?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Atumtsea elji ishirã dit cãsãbã sh-vinirã la nãsu.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Tu aestã oarã ucenitsilji a lui lji si-rugarã dzãcãnda: “Rabbi, mãcã!” <verse eid="JHN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Ma elu lã dzãsi a lor: “Mini am unã hranã trã mãcari tsi voi nu u cunushtets.” <verse eid="JHN 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Trã aestã ucenitsilji dzãtsea cu un-alantu: “Nacã lji-adusi vãrã ti mãcari?” <verse eid="JHN 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Isusul lã dzãsi a lor: “Hranea a mea easti tsi s-facã vrearea a atsilui tsi mi pitricu shi s-mplinescu lucrul a lui. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Nu dzãtsets voi, cã suntu ninga patru meshi sh-yini sitsirarea? Ia, mini ma vã dzãc, sculats ocljilji a voshtri sh-videts cãmpurili, cã tora atseali suntu albi di sitsirari. <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Sh-atsel tsi seatsirã u ljea plata sh-adunã carpolu trã bana eternã, tsi si s-hãrseascã deadun atsel tsi seaminã sh-atsel tsi seatsirã. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Cã tu aestã s-alihipseashti zborlu: ‘Un seaminã, sh-altul seatsirã.’ <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Mini vã pitricui si sitsirats atsea di cai voi nu lucrat. Altsã lucrarã sh-voi intrat tu lucrili a lor.”<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Multsã Samaritenji Pistipsirã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Multsã Samaritenji dit atsel cãsãbã pistipsirã la elu trã itia a zborlui a muljeariljei, tsi mãrtirsi: “Elu nji spusi tuti cãti am faptã.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Cãndu Samaritenjilji vinirã la nãsu, lji-si rugarã s-armãnã cu nãshi. Sh-elu stãtu aclo doauã dzãli. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Sh-multu ma multsã pistipsirã trã itia a zborlui a lui. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Elji lji dzãsirã a muljeariljei: “Nu esti mash trã itia a zboarilor a tali tsi pistipsim, cã noi idyilji avem avdzãt shi shtim cã elu easti dealihea Ascãpãtorlu a lumiljei.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Vindicã Hiljilu a Unui Administrator</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Sh-dupã atseali doauã dzãli, Isusul s-nchisi di aclo shi s-dusi tu Galilea, <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />cã idyiul Isusul mãrtirsi cã un prufit nu s-tinjiseashti tu vãtanea a lui. <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Cãndu agiumsi tu Galilea, Galileanjilji lu ashtiptarã, cã avea vidzut tuti atseali tsi avea faptã tu Ierusalem tu sãrbãtoarea a Pashtiljei, cã sh-elji s-eara dusã aclo. <verse eid="JHN 4:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Ashãtsi Isusul vini napoi tu Cana a Galileiljei, iu u-avea turnatã apa tu yin. Sh-aclo eara un administrator a amirãlui, sh-hiljilu a lui eara lãndzit tu Capernaum. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Aestu, cãndu avdzã cã Isusul avea vinit dit Iudea tu Galilea s-dusi la nãsu sh-lji-si rugã tsi s-dipuna shi s-vindica hiljilu a lui, cã eara ningã moarti. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Atumtsea Isusul lji-dzãsi: “Ma s-nu videts seamni sh-thavmati, voi nu va pistipsits.” <verse eid="JHN 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Administratorlu a amirãlui lji-dzãsi: “Doamne, dipunã ma nãinti tsi s-moarã ficiorlu!” <verse eid="JHN 4:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Isusul lji-dzãsi: “Du-ti, hiljilu a tãu bãneadzã!” Sh-omlu lji pistipsi a zborlui tsi lji-dzãsi Isusul shi s-dusi. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Cãndu elu ma dipuna, lj-ishirã nãinti huzmichearlji a lui shi lji dzãsirã: “Hiljilu a tãu bãneadzã!” <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Sh-elu lji ntribã tu tsi oarã s-featsi ma ghini. Sh-elji lji-dzãsirã: “Aieri pi unã dupã prãndzu u alãsarã hevrili.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Atumtsea tatãl aduchi cã eara tu atsea oarã tsi Isusul lji-avea dzãsã: “Hiljilu a tãu bãneadzã.” Sh-pistipsi elu sh-tutã casa a lui. <verse eid="JHN 4:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Isusul featsi sh-aestã a doaua thavmã, cãndu vini dit Iudea tu Galilea.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Vindicarea la Hãmami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Dupã aestã eara unã sãrbãtoari a Iudeilor sh-Isusul s-alinã tu Ierusalem <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Tu Ierusalem, ningã Poarta a oilor, easti unã hãmami tsi pi uvreieshti s-acljeami Betesda, sh-ari tsintsi purtitsi. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Tu aesti s-afla unã multsãmi mari di lãndzits; orghi, shcljiochi sh-paralizatsi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:3: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niscãnti manuscrisi au stihurli 3b-4: tsi ashtipta minarea a apãljei.<char style="fv">4</char> Cã un anghil, cãtã vãrãoarã dipuna tu hãmami sh-mintea apa, sh-protlu tsi intra, dupã tsi apa eara mintit, s-vindica di tuti lãngoarili.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Aclo eara un om niputut di treidzãtsioptu di anji. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Isusul, vidzãnda atsel ashtirnut shi shtinda cã di multu chiro eara lãndzit, lji-dzãsi: “Vrei s-ti fats sãnãtos?” <verse eid="JHN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Lãndzitlu lj-apãndisi: “Doamne, mini nu am om tsi cãndu s-minteashti apa, s-mi bagã tu hãmami. Sh-pãnã mi duc mini, un altã dipuni nãinti di mini.” <verse eid="JHN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Isusul lji dzãsi: “Scoalã-ti, ljea patlu a tãu sh-imnã!” <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Omlu s-vindicã tu oara atsea, lo patlu a lui sh-imnã. (Atsea dzuã eara Sãmbãtã.) <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Trã atsea mãrlji a Iudeilor lji dzãsirã atsilui tsi s-vindicã: “Easti Sãmbãtã, nu easti tu lege trã tini s-ljeai patlu a tãu!” <verse eid="JHN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Elu lã apãndisi a lor: “Atsel tsi mi vindicã nji dzãsi: ‘Ljea patlu a tãu sh-imnã!’” <verse eid="JHN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Atumtsea elji lu ntribarã: “Cai easti atsel cai ts-dzãsi: ‘Ljea patlu a tãu sh-imnã’?” <verse eid="JHN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Ma atsel tsi eara vindicat nu lu shtia cai eara, cã Isusul eara dipãrtat namisa di lumea tsi eara tu atsel loc. <verse eid="JHN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Deapoea Isusul lu aflã tu templu sh-lji dzãsi: “Ia, tini ti vindicash! Nu amãrtisea ma tra s-nu pats tsiva ma arãu.” <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Deapoea omlu s-dusi sh-lã spusi a Iudeilor cã Isusul eara atsel cai lu vindicã.<verse eid="JHN 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Autoritatea a Hiljilui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Trã aestã, Iudeilji apãrnjirã su avina Isusul, cã fãtsea aesti lucri Sãmbãta. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Ma Isusul lã apãndisi a lor: “Tatãl a meu ma lucreadzã pãnã tora, sh-mini ma lucredz.” <verse eid="JHN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Trã aestã mãrlji a Iudeilor cãfta sh-ma multu s-lu vãtãma, cã nu mash ncãlca Sãmbãta, ma sh-trã atsea tsi dzãtsea cã Dumnidzãlu eara Tatãl a lui, shi s-fãtsea isa cu Dumnidzãlu. <verse eid="JHN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Atumtsea Isusul lã apãndãsi a lor: “Dealihea ma vã dzãc, cã Hiljilu nu poati s-facã tsiva di la nãsu, dicãt mash atsea tsi veadi cã fatsi Tatãl. Lucrili tsi fatsi Tatãl, li fatsi tutashã sh-Hiljilu. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Cã Tatãl lu va Hiljilu a lui sh-lji aspuni itsido tsi fatsi, sh-va lji aspunã fapti ma mãri di aesti, tsi voi s-vã ciudisits. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Ashãtsi cum Tatãl nyeadzã mortsãlji sh-lã da atsilor bana, tutashãtsi sh-Hiljilu da bana a cuitsido tsi va. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Cã Tatãl nu giudicã vãrã, ma tutã giudicarea lji-u deadi a Hiljilui, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />tsi tuts s-lu tinjiseascã Hiljilu ashãtsi cum tinjisescu Tatãl. Cai nu lu tinjiseashti Hiljilu, nu tinjiseashti Tatãl, tsi lu ari pitricut. <verse eid="JHN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />Dealihea ma vã dzãc: Atsel tsi ascultã zborlu a meu sh-pistipseashti la atsel tsi mi ari pitricut, ari banã eternã, sh-elu nu yini la giudicari, ma ari tricut di la moarti tu banã. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Dealihea ma vã dzãc, ma yini oara, meti ari vinitã, cãndu mortsãlji va s-avdã boatsea a Hiljilui a Dumnidzãlui, shi atselji tsi u au avdzãtã va s-bãneadzã. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Cã, ashã cum Tatãl ari banã tu nãsu, ashãtsi lji u ari datã sh-a Hiljilui s-aibã banã tu nãsu. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Shi lji ari datã tutashã s-aibã puteari s-giudicã, cã easti Hiljilu a Omlui. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Nu vã ciudisits di aestã, cã ma yini oara tsi tuts atselji tsi suntu tu murmintsã va u avdã boatsea a lui. <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />Elji va s-easã di la murmintsã, sh-atselji tsi au faptã ghinetsi, s-nyeadzã trã bãnari, iarã-atselji tsi au faptã arali, s-nyeadzã trã giudicari. <verse eid="JHN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />Mini nu pot s-fac tsiva di la mini. Giudic dupã atsea tsi avdu sh-giudicata a mea easti ndreaptã, cã nu caftu s-fac vrearea a mea, ma vrearea a Tatãlui tsi mi ari pitricut.<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mãrtiria trã Isusul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />Macã mini mãrtirsescu trã mini, mãrtiria a mea nu easti alihioasã. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Easti un altu tsi mãrtirseashti trã mini, sh-mini u shtiu cã mãrtiria tsi fatsi elu trã mini easti alihioasã. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Voi avets pitricut la Ioanul sh-elu mãrtirsi trã alihea. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Tora mini nu am ananghi trã mãrtirii di la vãrã om, ma li dzãc aesti tsi voi s-ascãpats. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Ioanul eara unã cãndilã tsi s-ardi sh-lunjineadzã, shi voi vrut s-hãrsits di putsãn chiro tu lunjina a lui. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Ma mini am mãrtirii ma mari di atsea a Ioanului. Faptili tsi Tatãl nji ari datã sã mplinescu, atseali fapti tsi mini ma fac, mãrtirsescu cã Tatãl mi ari pitricut. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Tatãl tsi mi pitricu, elu idyiul ari mãrtirsit trã mini. Voi nu u avets avdzãtã pute boatsea a lui sh-nitsi nu u avets vidzutã fatsa a lui, <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />shi nu lu avets zborlu a lui tsi s-bãneadzã la voi, cã voi nu pistipsits la atsel tsi elu ari pitricut. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Voi cãftats Scriturili cã minduits s-avets prit eali banã eternã. Scriturili suntu aesti tsi mãrtirsescu trã mini. <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Ma voi nu vrets s-yinits la mini tsi s-avets banã. <verse eid="JHN 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />Mini nu am ananghi trã mãrirea a oaminjlor. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Ma mini vã cunoscu, tsi nu avets vreari trã Dumnidzãlu tu ininjli a voastri. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Mini am vinitã tu numa a Tatãlui a meu, sh-voi nu mi aprucheats, ma s-yinea vãrã altu tu numa a lui, voi va lu aprucheat. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Cum putets s-pistipsits voi, tsi loats mãriri di un-alantu, sh-nu cãftats mãrirea tsi yini di la singurlu Dumnidzã? <verse eid="JHN 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />S-nu minduits cã mini vã acuzescu la Tatãl. Easti Moisiul tsi vã acuzeashti, la cai voi aveat nãdãit. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Macã voi va lj-pistipsit dealihea a Moisiului, va mi pistipseatã sh-mini, cã elu ari scriatã trã mini. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Ma macã voi nu pistipsits la scriturili a lui, cum va s-pistipsits la zboarili a meali?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s1">Isusul Hrãneashti Tsintsi Njilji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Dupã aesti, Isusul s-dusi napãrti di amarea a Galileiljei (tsi easti acljimat a Tiberiljei). <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Unã multsãmi mari l-urma, cã videa seamnili tsi elu fãtsea pri nipututslji. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Isusul s-alinã pri munti sh-aclo shidzu cu ucenitsilji a lui. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Pashtili, sãrbãtoarea a Iudeilor eara aproapi. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Isusul sculã ocljilji shi, vidzãnda cã unã multsãmi mari ma yinea la nãsu, lji dzãsi al Filip, “Iu va s-acumpãrãm pãni tra s-mãcã aeshti?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Ma elu u dzãtsea aestã tra s-lu bãga tu provã Filipul, cã elu lu shtia cã tsi va s-fãtsea. <verse eid="JHN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Filipul lji apãndisi, “Doauã suti di denari pãni nu va s-agiungã, tsi cathiun di elji s-aibã cãti unã bucatã.” <verse eid="JHN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Andrea, fratili al Simon Petru, un di ucenitsilji a lui, lji dzãsi: <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />“Aoa easti un ficior tsi ari tsintsi pãnji di ordzu sh-doi peshti njitsi, ma tsi suntu aesti ti ahãntsã oaminji?” <verse eid="JHN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Sh-Isusul dzãsi, “Dzãtsets-lã a oaminjlor s-sheadã!” Ma tu atsel loc avea multã iarbã. Oaminjlji shidzurã sh-eara aproapi di tsintsi njilji. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Deapoea Isusul lo pãnjili shi, dupã tsi hãristisi, lã li deadi atsilor cai shidea, ashãtsi featsi sh-cu peshtilji, ahãt cãt vrurã. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Dupã tsi elji s-fãnãtirã, Isusul lã dzãsi a ucenitsilor a lui: “Adunats bucãtsili tsi armasirã, tra s-nu chearã tsiva!” <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Li adunarã tuti, shi umplurã doisprãdzatsi di coashi cu bucãtsili di atseali tsintsi pãnji di ordzu tsi lã armasirã atsilor tsi avea mãcatã. <verse eid="JHN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Atumtsea oaminjlji, cãndu vidzurã semnu tsi featsi Isusul, dzãsirã, “Dealihea aestu easti Prufitlu tsi va s-yinã tu lumi.” <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Ma Isusul shtinda cã ma yinea s-lu acãtsa shi s-lu fãtsea cu zori amirã, s-trapsi nãpoi pri munti singur dip.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Imnã pristi Apã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Cãndu ntunicã, ucenitsilji a lui s-dipusirã cãtrã amari. <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />Intrarã tu varcã shi s-dusirã tu alantã parti a amariljei cãtrã Capernaum. Tora eara scutidisit sh-Isusul ninga nu avea vinitã la elji. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Amarea eara mintit, cã vimtul sufla multu vãrtos. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Shi dupã tsi avea datã a lupãtsilor vãrã trei icã patru milji, vidzurã Isusul tsi imna pristi amari, ma s-apruchea di varcã, sh-elji s-aspãrarã. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Ma elu lã dzãsi a lor: “Escu mini, nu vã aspãrats!” <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Elji vrurã s-lu ljea tu varcã, shi trãoarã varca agiumsi la loclu cãtrã iu s-dutsea. <verse eid="JHN 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Alantã dzuã multsãmea, tsi avea armasã di alantã parti a amariljei, vidzu cã aclo nu avea altã varcã, dicãt mash unã. Ucenitsilji al Isus avea intratã la varcã, ma elu nu avea intratã cu nãshi, cã ucenitsilji a lui eara nchisitã singuri. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Ma vinirã alti vãrtsi di Tiberiada, aproapi di loclu iu avea mãcatã pãni, dupã tsi Domnul avea hãristisitã. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Multsãmea, cãndu vidzu cã Isusul nu eara aclo sh-nitsi ucenitsilji a lui, intrarã sh-nãshi prit vãrtsi sh-vinirã tu Capernaum cãftãnda Isusul.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Easti Pãnea a Banãljei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Cãndu lu aflarã napãrti di amari lu ntribarã: “Rabbi, cãndu vinish aoa?” <verse eid="JHN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Isusul lã apãndisi: “Dealihea ma vã dzãc cã voi mi cãftats nu cã vidzut seamnili, ma cã avets mãcat di pãnjili shi hits fãnãtit. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Nu lucrats trã hranea tsi s-aspardzi, ma trã hranea tsi armãni trã bana eternã, tsi va vã-u da Hiljilu a Omlui, cã pri nãsu Tatãl Dumnidzãlu bãgã vula a lui a aprucheariljei.” <verse eid="JHN 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Atumtsea elji ntribarã: “Tsi prindi s-fãtsem tra s-adrãm lucrili a Dumnidzãlui?” <verse eid="JHN 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Isusul lã apãndisi: “Aestu easti lucrul a Dumnidzãlui: tsi voi s-pistipsits tu atsel tsi elu ari pitricut.” <verse eid="JHN 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Atumtsea elji lu ntribarã: “Tsi semnu fats tini tsi noi s-lu videm shi s-ti pistipsim? Tsi lucru va s-fats tini? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Pãrintsãlji a noshtri mãcarã mannã tu irnjii, cum easti scriatã: ‘Elu lã deadi s-mãcã pãni dit tser.’” <verse eid="JHN 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Atumtsea Isusul lã dzãsi a lor: “Dealihea ma vã dzãc, cã nu vã ari datã Moisiul pãni dit tser, ma Tatãl a meu vã da pãnea atsea alihioasa dit tser. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Cã pãnea a Dumnidzãlui easti atsea tsi dipuni dit tser shi lji-da banã a lumiljei.” <verse eid="JHN 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Atumtsea elji lji dzãsirã: “Doamne, dã-nã totãna pãnea aestã!” <verse eid="JHN 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Sh-Isusul lã dzãsi a lor: “Mini escu pãnea a banãljei. Cai yini la mini nu va s-aibã pute foami sh-cai pistipseashti la mini, nu va s-aibã pute seati. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Ma mini vã dzãsh: cã voi mi-avets vidzutã, ma nu pistipsits. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Tuti tsi nji-li da Tatãl va s-yinã la mini, sh-atsel tsi yini la mini, mini nu va u scotã nafoarã pute, <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />cã mini am dipunatã dit tser tra s-nu fac vrearea a mea, ma vrearea atsilui tsi mi ari pitricut. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Aestã easti vrearea a Tatãlui cai mi pitricu, tsi mini s-nu cher nitsiunu di tuti atselji tsi elu nji ari datã, ma s-lji nyedz tu dzua di soni. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Aestã easti vrearea a Tatãlui a meu, tsi caitsido tsi veadi Hiljilu sh-pistipseashti tu nãsu, s-aibã banã eternã, sh-mini va lu nyedz atsel tu dzua di soni.” <verse eid="JHN 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Iudeilji, murmurea cãtrã nãsu, cã avea dzãsã: “Mini escu pãnea tsi dipunã dit tser.” <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Elji dzãtsea: “Nu easti aestu Isusul, hiljilu al Iosif, a cui lji shtim tat-su sh-mã-sa? Cum dzãtsi tora aestu: ‘Mini dipunai dit tser’?” <verse eid="JHN 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Atumtsea Isusul lã dzãsi a lor: “Nu murmurats namisa di voi. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Vãrã nu poati s-yinã la mini, ma fu cã Tatãl tsi mi ari pitricut nu va lu-tragã sh-mini va lu-nyedz tu dzua di soni. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />La Prufitsilji easti scriatã: ‘Tuts va s-hibã nvitsats di la Dumnidzãlu.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:13">Isa 54:13</ref>.</char></note> Caitsido, tsi ari avdzãtã sh-nvitsatã di la Tatãl, yini la mini. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Vãrã nu lu ari vidzutã Tatãl, mash atsel tsi easti di la Dumnidzãlu. Elu singur lu ari vidzutã Tatãl. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Dealihea ma vã dzãcã, cai pistipseashti tu mini ari bana eternã. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Mini escu pãnea a banãljei. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Ntãnjilji a voshtri mãcarã mannã tu irnjii sh-murirã. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Aestã easti pãnea tsi dipuni dit tser, sh-cai va s-mãcã, nu va s-moarã. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Mini escu pãnea atsea yii tsi dipunã dit tser. Macã vãrã va s-mãcã di aestã pãni, va s-bãneadzã di totãna. Aestã pãni easti truplu a meu, tsi mini va u-dau trã bana a lumiljei.” <verse eid="JHN 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Atumtsea Iudeilji ahurhirã si ncãcea cu un-alantu dzãcãnda: “Cum poati aestu s-nã da s-mãcãm truplu a lui?” <verse eid="JHN 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Atumtsea Isusul lã dzãsi atsilor: “Dealihea ma vã dzãc, ma s-nu mãcats truplu a Hiljilui a Omlui shi s-nu bets sãndzili a lui, nu avets banã tu voi. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Cai l-mãcã truplu a meu sh-u bea sãndzili a meu, ari banã di totãna sh-mini va lu nyedz dzua di soni. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Cã truplu a meu easti dealihea hranã sh-sãndzili a meu easti dealihea biuturã. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Cai l-mãcã truplu a meu sh-u bea sãndzili a meu, armãni tu mini sh-mini tu nãsu. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Ashã-cum Tatãl atsel yiulu mi ari pitricut sh-mini bãnedz di la Tatãl, ashã sh-atsel tsi va mi mãcã mini va s-bãneadzã sh-elu di la mini. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Aestã easti pãnea tsi dipunã dit tser. Nu easti ca manna tsi mãcarã ntãnjilji a voshtri sh-murirã. Cai mãcã di aestã pãni va s-bãneadzã di totãna.” <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Aesti dzãsi Isusul nvitsãnda tu sinagogã tu Capernaum.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Multsã Ucenitsi s-Dipãrteadzã di Isusul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Cãndu li avdzãrã aesti, multsã di ucenitsilji a lui dzãsirã: “Greu easti aestu zbor, cai poati s-lu ascultã?” <verse eid="JHN 6:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Ma Isusul, shtinda cã ucenitsilji a lui ma murmurea di aestã, lã dzãsi a lor: “Aestã vã cicãrdiseashti? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Tsi va s-eara ma s-lu videat Hiljilu a Omlui alinãnda aclo iu eara ma nãinti? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Easti Duhlu tsi da banã, truplu nu s-hãrzãeashti tsiva. Zboarili tsi mini vã am dzãsã suntu Duh sh-banã. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Ma suntu niscãntsã namisa di voi tsi nu pistipsescu.” Isusul lu shtia di tu ahurhitã cai eara atselji tsi nu pistipsea, shi cai eara atsel tsi va lu pridea. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Sh-elu dzãtsea: “Trã aestã vã dzãsh, cã nitsiun nu poati s-yinã la mini, macã nu lji easti datã di la Tatãl a meu.” <verse eid="JHN 6:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Di atumtsea multsã di ucenitsilji a lui s-trapsirã nãpoi sh-nu imna ma cu nãsu. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Atumtsea Isusul lã ntribã di doisprãdzatslji: “Voi nu vrets s-vã dipãrtats?” <verse eid="JHN 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Sh-Simon Petrul lj-apãndisi: “Doamne, la cai s-nã dutsem? Tini ai zboarãli a banãljei eternã. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Noi avem vinit s-pistipsim shi s-cunushtem cã tini eshti Sãmtul a Dumnidzãlui.” <verse eid="JHN 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Isusul lã apãndisi a lor: “Nu vã-am aleaptã mini voi, di doisprãdzatsi? Ma un di voi easti drac!” <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Sh-elu dzãtsea ti Iuda, hiljilu al Simon Iscariotul, cã aestu va s-lu prida, sh-cãtse eara un di doisprãdzatslji.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s1">Isusul la Sãrbãtoarea a Tabernachilor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Dupã aesti, Isusul imna prit Galilea, cã nu vrea s-imna prit Iudea, trã atsea cã mãrlji a Iudeilor cãfta s-lu vãtãma. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Sãrbãtoarea a Iudeilor, atsea a Tabernachilor eara aproapi. <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Trã atsea, fratslji a lui lji dzãsirã: “Fudz di aoa sh-duti tu Iudea, tsi sh-ucenitsilji a tãlji s-li veadã faptili tsi tini fats. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Cã vãrã nu fatsi tsiva pri ascumtu cãndu caftã si s-cunoascã la tutã dunjeaua. Macã tini vrei s-fats ahtãri lucri, aspuni-ti la dunjeaua!” <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Cã nitsi fratslji a lui nu pistipsea la nãsu. <verse eid="JHN 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Atumtsea Isusul lã dzãsi a lor: “Chirolu a meu nu ari vinitã ninga, ma chirolu a vostru easti totãna etimu. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Lumea nu poati s-vã aurascã a voauã, ma mini mi aurashti cã mini mãrtirsescu cã faptili a ljei suntu arali. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Voi njidzets la aestã sãrbãtoari. Mini nu ma mi duc ninga la aestã sãrbãtoari, cã chirolu a meu ninga nu easti mplinitã.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Shi cum dzãsi aesti a lor, armasi tu Galilea. <verse eid="JHN 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Dupã tsi fratslji a lui s-dusirã la sãrbãtoari, atumtsea sh-elu s-dusi aclo nu discljis, ma pri ascumtu. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Atumtsea mãrlji a Iudeilor lu cãfta tu dzua a sãrbãtoariljei sh-ntriba: “Iu easti atsel?” <verse eid="JHN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Tu mesea a multsãmiljei s-pushpura multu ti nãsu. Niscãntsã dzãtsea: “Elu easti bun.” Altsi dzãtsea: “Nu, cã elu arãdi populu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Ma nitsiun nu grea discljis-cu boatsi ti nãsu di frica a mãrljilor a Iudeilor.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Nveatsi la Sãrbãtoari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Ma cãtrã la giumitatea a sãrbãtoariljei, Isusul s-alinã tu templu sh-ahurhi si nvitsa. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Shi Iudeilji s-ciudisea dzãcãnda: “Cum li shti aestu gramatli, cu tutã cã nu ari nvitsatã?” <verse eid="JHN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Isusul atumtsea lj-apãndãsi a lor: “Nvitsãtura a mea nu easti di la mini, ma di la atsel tsi mi ari pitricut. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Macã vãrã va s-facã vrearea a Dumnidzãlui, va u cunoascã, cã aestã nvitsãturã yini di la Dumnidzãlu, icã mini grescu cu mintea a mea. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Atsel tsi greashti cu mintea a lui caftã mãrirea a lui, iarã atsel tsi caftã mãrirea atsilui tsi lu ari pitricut easti alihios, sh-tu nãsu nu ari nindriptati. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Nu vã-u ari datã Moisiul legea? Cu tutã atsea, nitsiun di voi nu u bagã tu practicã legea. Cãtse cãftats s-mi vãtãmats?” <verse eid="JHN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Multsãmea lji apãndisi: “Tini ai un drac, cai caftã s-ti vatãmã?” <verse eid="JHN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Isusul lã dzãsi a lor: “Mini am faptã unã thavmã sh-voi tuts hits ciudisits. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Trã atsea Moisiul vã deadi anvãrliga-tãljearea, sh-atsea nu easti di la Moisiul, ma di la patriarhilji, sh-voi anvãrliga-tãljeats un ficior Sãmbãta. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Macã un om fatsi anvãrliga-tãljeari Sãmbãta, tsi nu s-aspargã legea al Moisiu, cãtse vã nãrãits cu mini cã vindicai ntreg un om Sãmbãta?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:1-10">Ioan 5:1-10</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Nu giudicats dupã videarea di nafoarã, ma giudicats cu ndriptati!” <verse eid="JHN 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Atumtsea niscãntsã di Ierusalem dzãsirã: “Nu easti aestu atsel tsi l-caftã s-lu vatãmã? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Sh-ia, elu ma greashti discljis shi nu lj-dzãc tsiva. Nacã lu-au cunuscutã mãrlji cã dealihea elu easti Hristolu? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Noi shtim cã di iu easti aestu, iarã cãndu s-yinã Hristolu, vãrã nu va shtibã cã di iu easti elu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Atumtsea Isusul, nvitsãnda tu templu grãi: “Voi mi cunushtets sh-mi shtits cã di iu escu. Cu tutã atsea, mini nu am vinitã cu autoritatea a mea, ma atsel tsi mi pitricu easti alihios sh-voi nu lu cunushtets. <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Ma mini atsel lu cunoscu, cã escu di la elu, sh-elu mi pitricu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Trã atsea elji cãfta s-lu acãtsa, ma vãrã nu bãgã mãna pri nãsu, cã oara a lui nu avea vinitã ninga. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Multsã oaminji di multsãmea pistipsirã la nãsu sh-dzãtsea: “Cãndu s-yinã Hristolu, va s-facã ma multi thavmati di tsi ari faptã aestu?” <verse eid="JHN 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Fariseilji avdzãrã multsãmea pushpurãnda aesti trã nãsu. Trã atsea arhipreftsãlji sh-Fariseilji pitricurã vigljitorlji s-lu acãtsa. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Atumtsea Isusul lã dzãsi a lor: “Mini escu ninga putsãn chiro cu voi, deapoea va mi duc la atsel tsi mi ari pitricut. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Va mi cãftats, ma nu va mi aflats, sh-aclo iu escu mini, voi nu putets s-yinits.” <verse eid="JHN 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Atumtsea Iudeilji dzãtsea cu un-alantu: “Iu va s-ducã aestu tsi noi nu va lu aflãm? Nacã va s-ducã la atselji tsi suntu arãspãndits namisa di Elinji, shi s-nveatsã Elinjilji? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Tsi easti aestu zbor tsi elu dzãsi: ‘Voi va mi cãftats sh-nu va mi aflats,’ shi: ‘Aclo iu escu mini, voi nu putets s-yinits’?”<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Tu dzua di soni, dzua atsea marea a sãrbãtoariljei, Isusul si sculã pri cicioari sh-grãi cu boatsi analtã: “Macã vãrã ari seati, s-yinã la mini <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />sh-atsel tsi pistipseashti la mini va s-bea. Ashã cum ari dzãsã Scritura, di nãuntru a lui va s-curã arãuri di apã yii.” <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Ma aestã elu u dzãsi trã Duhlu, tsi va u loa ma napoi atselji tsi va s-pistipsea la nãsu. Cã Duhlu Sãmtu nu fu datã ninga, cã Isusul ninga nu eara multumãrit. <verse eid="JHN 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Cãndu li avdzãrã aesti zboari, niscãntsã oaminji di multsãmea dzãsirã: “Aestu easti dealihea Prufitlu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Altsã dzãtsea: “Aestu easti Hristolu.” Iarã altsã ntriba: “Vahi di Galilea yini Hristolu? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Nu dzãtsi Scritura cã Hristolu yini di fara a Davidlui sh-di Betlehem, hoara iu bãna Davidul?” <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Ashã avu dispãrtsãri la multsãmea trã itia al Isus. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Shi niscãntsã di elji vrurã s-lu acãtsa, ma vãrã nu bãgã mãna pri nãsu.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nipistipsirea a Mãrlor la Iudeilji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Atumtsea, vigljitorlji s-turnarã la mãrlji a preftsãlor sh-la Fariseilji, sh-aeshti lã dzãsirã a lor: “Cãtse nu lu adusit?” <verse eid="JHN 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Vigljitorlji apãndisirã: “Pute nu ari gritã vãrã om ca aestu!” <verse eid="JHN 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Atumtsea Fariseilji lã apãndisirã a lor: “Nacã vã arãsi sh-voi? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Nacã vãrã di mãrlji icã di Fariseilji ari pistipsitã la nãsu? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Ma aestã multsãmi, tsi nu u cunoashti legea, easti blãstimatã.” <verse eid="JHN 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Nicodemul, atsel tsi avea vinitã ma nãinti la Isusul, hinda un di Fariseilji lã ntribã: <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />“Legea a noastrã giudicã vahi un om nãinti tsi s-lu avdã shi s-lu shtii cã tsi ari faptã?” <verse eid="JHN 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Elji apãndisirã: “S-nu eshti sh-tini di Galilea? Caftã sh-va s-aflã cã di Galilea nu ari ishit vãrã prufit.” <verse eid="JHN 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Manuscrisili atseli ma vecljilji tu gãrtseashti nu au stihurli at Ioan di la 7:53 pãn la 8:11 </char></note>Shi cathiun s-dusi la casa a lui.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s1">Muljearea tsi Cãlcã Curuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />[Sh-Isusul s-dusi tu muntili a Masnjilor. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Ma, cum deadi dzua, s-turnã nãpoi tu templu sh-tut populu vini la elu, sh-elu s-apunã sh-lji nvitsa. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Atumtsea scriblji shi Fariseilji lji adusirã unã muljeari tsi eara acãtsatã cãlcãnda curuna. Dupã tsi u bãgarã tu mesi, <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />lji dzãsirã a Isusului: “Nvitsãtore, aestã muljeari u avem acãtsatã cãlcãnda curuna. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Tu lege Moisiul nã ari dimãndatã si s-vatãmã cu chetri ahtãri muljeri, ma tini tsi dzãts?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Aestã elji u dzãsirã tsi s-lu bãga tu provã shi s-afla itii s-lu giudica. Ma Isusul, s-aplicã shi scria cu dzeaditlu pri loc. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Sh-dupã tsi elji dipriunã lu ntriba, elu si sculã sh-lã dzãsi a lor: “Cai di voi easti fãrã amãrtii, s-arucã protlu cheatra pri ea!” <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Deapoea s-aplicã nãpoi shi scria pri loc. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Atumtsea elji, u avdzãrã aestã shi s-dipãrtarã un cãti un, apãrnjinda di la ma vecljilji, pãnã cãndu Isusul armasi singur cu muljearea atsea tsi shidea aclo. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Isusul atumtsea si s-culã sh-u ntribã: “Muljeari, iu suntu acuzãtorlji a tãlji? Vãrã nu ti giudicã?” <verse eid="JHN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Shi ea apãndisi: “Vãrã, Doamne.” Isusul lji dzãsi: “Nitsi mini nu ti giudicã, duti sh-nu amãrtisea ma.”]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Atselu textu nu s-aflã tu manuscrisi atseli ma veaclji. Ma mults pistipseascã cã easti bãgat tu evanghelul al Ioan ma nãpoi dupã traditsia oralã. </char></note><verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ncãceari trã Mãrtiria al Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Sh-Isusul lã grãi a lor nãpoi dzãcãnda: “Mini escu lunjina trã lumea. Cai mi urmeadzã nu va s-imnã pute tu scutidi, ma va s-aibã lunjina a banãljei.” <verse eid="JHN 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Atumtsea Fariseilji lji dzãsirã: “Tini mãrtirseshti trã tini, mãrtiria a ta nu easti alihioasã.” <verse eid="JHN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Isusul apãndisi: “Sh-macã mãrtirsescu trã mini, mãrtiria a mea easti alihioasã, cã mini shtiu di iu am vinitã sh-iu mi duc. Ma voi nu shtits nits di iu yin, nits iu va mi duc. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Voi giudicats dupã pãrearea di nafoarã, mini nu giudic nitsiun. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Ma, sh-cãndu giudicã, giudicata a mea easti alihioasã, cã mini nu escu singur, ma escu cu Tatãl tsi mi pitricu. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Tu Legea a voastrã easti scriatã cã mãrtiria a doi oaminjlor easti alihioasã.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">Deut 19:15</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Mini escu atsel tsi mãrtirsescu trã mini, sh-Tatãl tsi mi ari pitricut mãrtirseashti trã mini.” <verse eid="JHN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Atumtsea lji ntribarã: “Iu easti Tatãl a tãu?” Isusul apãndisi: “Voi nu mi cunushtets nitsi mini, nitsi Tatãl a meu. Macã va mi cunushteat mini, va s-cunushteat sh-Tatãl a meu.” <verse eid="JHN 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Isusul li dzãsi aesti zboari nvitsãnda tu loclu a ayishteariljei a templui. Vãrã nu lu acãtsã, cã nu avea vinitã ninga oara a lui. <verse eid="JHN 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Isusul lã dzãsi a lor nãpoi: “Mini ma mi duc sh-voi va mi cãftats, sh-va murits tu amãrtia a voastrã. Aclo iu mi duc mini, voi nu putets s-yinits.” <verse eid="JHN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Trã atsea Iudeilji dzãtsea: “Nacã va si s-vatãmã, cã dzãtsi: ‘Iu mi duc mini, voi nu putets s-yinits’?” <verse eid="JHN 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Sh-elu lã dzãsi a lor: “Voi hits di nghios, iarã mini escu di nsus. Voi hits di aestã lumi, mini nu escu di aestã lumi. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Trã atsea vã dzãsh cã voi va murits tu amãrtiili a voastri. Macã voi nu pistipsits cã mini escu, voi va s-murits tu amãrtiili a voastri.” <verse eid="JHN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Atumtsea elji lu ntribarã: “Cai eshti tini?” Sh-Isusul lã apãndãsi a lor: “Exact, atsea tsi vã dzãsh di tu ahurhitã. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Multi lucri am ti dzãtseari sh-ti giudicari trã voi. Ma atsel tsi mi ari pitricut easti alihios shi atseali tsi am avdzãtã di la nãsu li dzãc a lumiljei.” <verse eid="JHN 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Elji nu aduchirã cã elu ma lã grea a lor di Tatãl a lui. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Atumtsea Isusul lã dzãsi a lor: “Cãndu s-lu avets anãltsat Hiljilu a Omlui, atumtsea va nvitsats cã ‘Mini escu’, sh-cã nu fac tsiva di la mini, ma dzãc ashã cum Tatãl mi ari nvitsat. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Sh-atsel tsi mi ari pitricut easti cu mini. Elu nu mi ari alãsat singur, cã fac totãna lucrili tsi lj-arãsescu a lui.” <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Tu oara tsi elu dzãtsea aesti zboari, multsã oaminji pistipsirã la nãsu.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ncãceari trã Dupã-yinitorlji al Abraham</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Atumtsea Isusul lã dzãsi a Iudeilor cai pistipsirã la nãsu: “Macã va armãnets tu nvitsãtura a mea, voi hits dealihea ucenitsilji a melji. <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Va u cunushtets alihea sh-ea va s-vã facã liberi.” <verse eid="JHN 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Elji lji apãndisirã: “Noi him dupã-yinitorlji al Abraham sh-nu avem fut pute sclayilji a vãrui. Cum pots s-dzãts tini: ‘Va hits liberi’?” <verse eid="JHN 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Isusul lã apãndisi a lor: “Dealihea ma vã dzãc, cai fatsi amãrtii easti sclav a amãrtiiljei. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Sclavlu nu armãni di totãna la Fumealja, iarã hiljilu armãni di totãna. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Ashã, macã Hiljilu va vã facã liberi, va hits dealihea liberi. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Mini shtiu cã hits dupã-yinitorlji al Abraham, ma voi cãftats s-mi vãtãmats, cã zborlu a meu nu aflã loc la voi. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Mini zburãscu di atsea tsi am vidzutã la Tatãl a meu, sh-voi fãtsets atseali tsi avets avdzãtã di la tatãl a vostru.” <verse eid="JHN 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Elji apãndisirã: “Tatãl a nostru easti Abrahamul!” Isusul lã dzãsi a lor: “Macã va earat hiljilji a Abrahamului, va fãtseat faptili al Abraham. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Ma voi tora cãftats s-mi vãtãmats mini, un om tsi vã am aspus alihea tsi am avdzãtã di la Dumnidzãlu. Abrahamul aestã nu u featsi. <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Voi fãtsets faptili a tatãlui a vostru.” Atumtsea elji lji dzãsirã: “Noi nu ni amintãm di putãnsirili, noi avem un singur Tatã, Dumnidzãlu.” <verse eid="JHN 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Atumtsea Isusul lã dzãsi a lor: “Ma s-eara Dumnidzãlu Tatãl a vostru, voi va mi vreat, cã mini am vinit di la Dumnidzãlu. Nu am vinit di la mini, ma elu mi ari pitricut. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Cãtse nu aduchits dzãslu a meu? Cã nu putets s-lu ascultats zborlu a meu. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Voi hits di la draclu, tsi easti tatãl a vostru, sh-vrets s-fãtsets vrearili a tatãlui a vostru. Elu eara vãtãmãtor di tu ahurhitã shi nu armasi tu alihea, cã tu nãsu nu easti alihea. Cãndu dzãtsi arãdeari, greashti di la nãsu, cã easti arãdios shi tatãl a arãdeariljei. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Iarã mini, cu tutã cã vã dzãc alihea, nu mi pistipsits. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Cai di voi nji dzãtsi cã am amãrtii? Macã dzãc alihea, cãtse nu mi pistipsits? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Cai easti di la Dumnidzãlu, li ascultã zboarili a Dumnidzãlui. Trã atsea voi nu ascultats, cã nu hits di la Dumnidzãlu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Aspuni ti Nãsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Atumtsea Iudeilji lji apãndisirã: “Nu dzãtsem ghini noi cã tini eshti Samaritan sh-cã ai un demon?” <verse eid="JHN 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Isusul dzãsi: “Mini nu am demon, ma tinjisescu Tatãl a meu, sh-voi mi dispretsuits. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Sh-mini nu caftu mãrirea a mea. Easti un tsi caftã mãrirea a mea sh-giudicã. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Dealihea ma vã dzãc, cã atsel tsi fatsi zborlu a meu, nu va-u veadã pute moartea.” <verse eid="JHN 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Atumtsea Iudeilji lji dzãsirã: “Tora videm, cã tini ai un demon. Abrahamul sh-prufitsilji au murit, iarã tini dzãts: ‘Macã vãrã fatsi zborlu a meu, nu va u veadã moartea pute.’ <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Nacã eshti ma mari di tatãl a nostru Abraham, cai ari murit? Sh-prufitsilji au murit, cai dzãts cã eshti?” <verse eid="JHN 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Isusul apãndisi: “Macã mini mi multumãrescu, mãrirea a mea nu easti tsiva. Easti Tatãl a meu tsi mi multumãreashti, trã cai voi dzãtsets cã easti Dumnidzãlu a vostru. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Ma voi ninga nu lu avets cunuscut, iarã mini lu cunoscu. Ma s-vã dzãc cã nu lu cunoscu, va s-earam un arãdios ca voi. Mini lu cunoscu sh-lu fac zborlu a lui. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Abrahamul, tatãl a vostru, s-hãrsea cu nãdia tsi s-videa dzua a vinitãljei a mea, u vidzu shi s-hãrsi.” <verse eid="JHN 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Atumtsea, Iudeilji lji dzãsirã: “Tini ninga nu eshti tsindzãtsi di anji sh-ai vidzutã Abrahamul?” <verse eid="JHN 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Isusul lã dzãsi a lor: “Dealihea, mini ma vã dzãc, ma nãinti tsi s-aminta Abrahamul, ‘Mini escu’.” <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Atumtsea elji loarã chetsri, tsi s-arca cãtrã nãsu, ma Isusul s-ascumsi shi ishi dit templu.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s1">Isusul Vindicã un Om Amintat Orbu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Cãndu Isusul ma tritsea, elu vidzu un om tsi eara orbu di cãndu eara amintat. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Ucenitsilji a lui lu ntribarã: “Rabbi, cai ari amãrtisit, aestu icã pãrintsãlji a lui, tsi elu s-ari amintat orbu?” <verse eid="JHN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Isusul apãndisi: “Nitsi aestu nu ari amãrtisit, nitsi pãrintsãlji a lui, ma aestã s-featsi tsi la elu si aspunã faptili a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Noi prindi s-fãtsem faptili atsilui tsi mi ari pitricut pãnã cãndu easti dzuã. Noaptea ma yini, sh-vãrã nu poati s-lucreadzã. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Pãnã cãndu mini escu tu lumi, escu lunjina trã lumea.” <verse eid="JHN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Dupã tsi li avea dzãsã aesti, scuche mpadi sh-featsi muzgã sh-deapoea aumsi ocljilji a orbului cu muzgã. <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />Deapoea lji dzãsi: “Du-ti, aspeal-ti la ascãldãtoarea al Shiloam” (tsi va s-dzãc “Pitricut”). Elu s-dusi, s-aspilã shi s-turnã vidzãnda. <verse eid="JHN 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Atumtsea vitsinjlji sh-atselji tsi ma nãinti lu avea vidzut cã eara orbu sh-cãfta, dzãsirã: “Nu easti aestu atsel tsi shidea mpadi sh-cãfta cu mãna teasã?” <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Niscãntsã dzãtsea: “Elu easti.” Ma altsãlji dzãtsea: “Lj-undzeashti a lui.” Elu dzãtsea: “Mini escu.” <verse eid="JHN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Atumtsea elji lu ntribarã: “Cum tsã si discljisirã ocljilji?” <verse eid="JHN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Elu apãndisi: “Un om, tsi s-acljima Isus, featsi muzgã, nji-li aumsi ocljilji shi-nji dzãsi: ‘Duti la ascãldãtoarea al Shiloam shi aspealã-ti!’ Sh-mi dush aclo, mi aspilai sh-nji-si turnã lunjina a ocljilor.” <verse eid="JHN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Shi elji lu ntribarã: “Iu easti atsel?” Elu apãndisi: “Nu shtiu.”<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fariseilji Caftã trã Vindicarea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Atumtsea elji lu dusirã la Fariseilji atsel tsi ma nãinti eara orbu. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Shi eara Sãmbãtã cãndu Isusul adrã muzgã shi lji discljisi ocljilji. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Sh-Fariseilji lu ntribarã napoi cum u amintã lunjina a ocljilor. Sh-elu lã dzãsi a lor: “Nji-bãgã muzgã pri oclji, mi aspilai sh-ved.” <verse eid="JHN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Atumtsea niscãntsã di Fariseilji dzãsirã: “Aestu om nu easti di-la Dumnidzãlu, cã nu tsãni Sãmbãta!” Altsã dzãtsea: “Cum poati s-facã ahtãri seamni un om amãrtios?” Sh-avea un ngrãnji ntrã elji. <verse eid="JHN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Elji lu ntribarã napoi orbul: “Ma tini tsi dzãts ti atsel tsi s-discljisi ocljilji?” Ma elu dzãsi: “Easti un prufit!” <verse eid="JHN 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Mãrlji a Iudeilor nu pistipsirã cã elu fu orbu sh-avea amintat lunjina a ocljilor, trã atsea acljimarã pãrintsãlji a lui. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />Sh-lji ntribarã: “Easti aestu hiljilu a vostru, di cai voi dzãtsets cã s-amintã orbu? Cum poati tora tsi veadi?” <verse eid="JHN 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Pãrintsãlji a lui apãndisirã: “Shtim cã aestu easti hiljilu a nostru shi cã s-amintã orbu, <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />ma noi nu shtim cã cum veadi tora icã cai lji discljisi ocljilji a lui. Elu easti criscut, ntribats-lu, elu va-vã aspunã singur.” <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Aesti dzãsirã pãrintsãlji a lui, cã avea fricã di mãrlji a Iudeilor, cã elji avea apofãsitã cã, macã vãrã va lu cunushtea Isusul ca Hristos, va lu scutea nafoarã dit sinagogã. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Trã atsea pãrintsãlji a lui dzãsirã: “Easti criscut, ntribats-lu!” <verse eid="JHN 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Atumtsea elji acljimarã napoi omlu tsi fu orbu sh-lji dzãsirã, “Dã-lji mãriri a Dumnidzãlui sh-dzã alihea. Noi shtim cã atsel om easti amãrtios.” <verse eid="JHN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Elu atumtsea apãndisi, “Macã easti amãrtios, nu shtiu, ma un tsiva shtiu, cã earam orbu sh-tora ved.” <verse eid="JHN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Ma napoi lu ntribarã, “Tsi s-featsi? Cum tsã si discljisirã ocljilji?” <verse eid="JHN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Elu apãndisi a lor, “Mini tora vã am dzãsã sh-voi nu avets avdzãtã, cãtse vrets s-u avdzãts napoi? Vrets vahi s-vã fãtsets sh-voi ucenitsilji a lui?” <verse eid="JHN 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Ma elji lu ngiurarã shi lj-dzãsirã: “Tini eshti uceniclu a lui, ma noi him ucenitsilji a Moisiului. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Noi shtim cã Dumnidzãlu lji grãi a Moisiului, ma atsel nu shtim cã di iu easti.” <verse eid="JHN 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Omlu apãndisi sh-lã dzãsi a lor: “Ia, aestã easti trã ciudii tsi voi s-nu shtits cã di iu easti, cu tutã cã elu nji discljisi ocljilji! <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Noi shtim cã Dumnidzãlu nu lji ascultã amãrtioshlji. Ma macã vãrã ari fricã di Dumnidzãlu sh-fatsi vrearea a lui, elu aestu lu ascultã. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Di tu ahurhita a lumiljei nu easti avdzãtã tsi vãrã s-lji aibã discljisã ocljilji a unui om amintat orbu. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Ma s-nu eara aestu di la Dumnidzãlu, nu va s-putea s-fãtsea tsiva.” <verse eid="JHN 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Elji lj-apãndisirã: “Tini ti-ai amintatã ntreg tu amãrtii sh-vrei s-nã nvets noi?” Sh-lu scoasirã nafoarã.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Urghirea Sufliteascã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Isusul avdzã cã lu scoasirã nafoarã shi cãndu u aflã, lj-dzãsi: “Pistipseashti tini tu Hiljilu a Omlui?” <verse eid="JHN 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Elu apãndisi: “Cai easti, Doamne? Dzã-nji tra s-pistipsescu la elu?” <verse eid="JHN 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Shi Isusul lji dzãsi: “Lu ai vidzut, atsel tsi ma greashti cu tini. Elu easti.” <verse eid="JHN 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Atumtsea elu dzãsi: “Mini pistipsescu, Doamne!” Shi lji-si aplicã a lui. <verse eid="JHN 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Deapoea Isusul dzãsi: “Mini am vinit tu aestã dunjeauã tra s-facã giudicatã, tsi atselji tsi nu ved s-veadã, sh-atselji tsi veadã, s-urgheascã.” <verse eid="JHN 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Sh-niscãntsã di Fariseilji tsi eara cu elu li avdzãrã aesti sh-lu ntribarã: “Him orghi sh-noi?” <verse eid="JHN 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Isusul lã dzãsi a lor: “Ma s-earat orghi nu va s-aveat armasã tu amãrtii, ma tora dzãtsets: ‘Noi videm,’ trã atsea amãrtia a voastrã armãni.”<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s1">Bunlu Picurar sh-Oili a Lui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />“Dealihea, ma vã dzãc, atsel cai nu intrã prit poartã la strunga a oilor, ma s-alinã prit unã altã parti, atsel easti fur sh-furcudar. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Atsel cai intrã prit poartã, easti picurarlu a oilor. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Atsilui lji-u discljidi portarlu, sh-oili u ascultã boatsea a lui. Elu li acljeamã oili a lui pi numã sh-li scoati nafoarã. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Shi, dupã tsi li ari scoasã oili a lui, s-dutsi nãintea a lor, sh-oili lu urmeadzã, cã cunoscu boatsea a lui. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Un xen nu-lu urmeadzã, ma va s-fug di la nãsu, cã nu-u cunoscu boatsea a xenjilor.” <verse eid="JHN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Isusul lã-u spusi a-lor aestã parabolã, ma elji nu aduchirã tsi eara atsea tsi ma lã spunea. <verse eid="JHN 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Trã atsea Isusul lã dzãsi a-lor napoi: “Dealihea, ma vã dzãc, mini escu poarta trã oili. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Tuts atselji cãts vinirã nãintea a mea suntu furii shi furcudari, sh-oili nu lji ascultarã. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Mini escu poarta, macã vãrã intrã prit mini, va s-ascapã. Elu va s-intrã, sh-va s-easã, shi va aflã livãdzi. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Furlu yini mash s-furã, s-vatãmã, shi s-aspargã. Mini am vinit tsi elji s-aibã banã shi s-u aibã mplinã. <verse eid="JHN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />Mini escu picurarlu atsel bunlu. Picurarlu atsel bunlu da bana a lui ti oili. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Ma plãtitlu, cai nu easti picurar, sh-oili nu suntu a lui, cãndu l-veadi luplu tsi yini, li alasi oili sh-fudzi, sh-luplu li arãcheashti oili sh li scurpiseashti. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Plãtitlu fudzi, cã easti plãtit sh-nu va sã shti di oili. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />Mini escu picurarlu atsel bunlu, li cunoscu oili a meali shi eli mi cunoscu mini <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />ashã cum mi cunoashti mini Tatãl sh-mini lu cunoscu Tatãl. Mini u dau bana a mea trã oili. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Mini am sh-alti oi tsi nu suntu di aestã strungã. Prindi s-li aduc sh-atseli, tra s-u ascultã boatsea a mea sh-va hibã unã singurã cupii sh-un singur picurar. <verse eid="JHN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />Trã atsea Tatãl mi va, cã mini u dau bana a mea tsi s-u ljeau napoi. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Vãrã nu u ljea di la mini, ma voi s-u dau mini. Mini am autoritati s-u alasã sh-am autoritati s-u ljeau napoi. Aestu ordin mini lu am loat di la Tatãl a meu.” <verse eid="JHN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Atumtsea s-featsi napoi unã mpãrtsãri namisa di Iudeilji trã itia a zboarilor aesti. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Sh-multsã di elji dzãtsea: “Elu ari un demon sh-nu easti ghini! Cãtse lu ascultats?” <verse eid="JHN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Altsã dzãtsea: “Aesti nu suntu zboarili a unui demonizat. Poati un demon s-discljidã ocljilji a orghilor?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ncuntrãri trã Zboarili al Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Eara sãrbãtoarea a lunjinilor<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Cu aestã sãrbãtoari elji aduc aminti dedicarea a templui.</char></note> tu Ierusalem sh-eara iarnã. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Isusul ma imna tu templu sum porticlu al Solomon. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Lu anvãrligarã Iudeilji shi lji dzãsirã: “Pãnã cãndu va-u alashã mintea a noastrã nisigurã? Macã tini eshti Hristolu, dzã-nã-u ntr-oclji.” <verse eid="JHN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Isusul lã apãndisi a lor: “Mini vã-u am dzãsã, ma voi nu pistipsits. Faptili tsi fac mini tu numa a Tatãlui a meu, atseali mãrtirsescu trã mini. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Ma voi nu pistipsits, cã nu hits dit oili a meali. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Oili a meali u ascultã boatsea a mea, sh-mini li cunoscu sh-mi urmeadzã. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Mini lã dau a lor bana eternã sh-nu va s-chearã pute, sh-vãrã nu va-li arãcheascã di mãna a mea. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Tatãl a meu, cai nji li-ari datã, easti ma marli di tuts, sh-vãrã nu poati s-li arãcheascã dit mãna a Tatãlui a meu. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Mini sh-Tatãl him un.” <verse eid="JHN 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Trã atsea Iudeilji loarã napoi chetsri s-lu vãtãma. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Isusul lã apãndisi a lor: “Vã spush multi lucri buni di la Tatãl a meu. Ti cai di aesti lucri mi agudits cu chetri?” <verse eid="JHN 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Iudeilji apãndisirã: “Noi nu ti agudim cu chetsri ti lucru bun, ma ti blãstenji. Cã tini, hiinda om, vrei s-ti fats Dumnidzã.” <verse eid="JHN 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Isusul lã apãndisi a lor: “Nu easti scriatã tu Legea a voastrã: ‘Mini dzãsh voi hits dumnidzã’?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 82:6">Ps 82:6</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Scritura nu poati s-ncalcã. Macã elu lji acljeami dumnidzadz atselji a cui lji-si dzãsi zborlu a Dumnidzãlui, <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />voi dzãtsets cã elu, tsi Tatãl lu ari sãmtsãtã sh-lu ari pitricut tu lumi: ‘Blastimã,’ cã ari dzãsã: ‘Mini escu Hiljilu a Dumnidzãlui’? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Macã mini nu fac faptili a Tatãlui a meu, nu mi pistipsits. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Macã li fac, sh-ma s-nu mi pistipsits mini, pistipsits la faptili, tsi s-cunushtets shi s-aduchits cã Tatãl easti tu mini shi mini tu nãsu.” <verse eid="JHN 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Atumtsea cãftarã napoi s-lu acãtsa, ma elu ascãpa di mãnjili a lor. <verse eid="JHN 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Shi s-turnã napãrti di Iordan, tu loclu iu ma nãinti Ioanul pãtidza, sh-armasi aclo. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Multsã oaminji vinirã la elu sh-dzãtsea: “Ioanul dealihea nu featsi nitsiun semnu, ma itsido tsi dzãsi di aestu eara alihioasã.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Sh-aclo multsã oaminji pistipsirã la elu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s1">Nyearea al Lazar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Vãrãoarã eara un lãndzit, Lazarul di Betania, di hoara ali Marii sh-ali Marti, sora a ljei. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Maria eara atsea tsi aumsi cu njir Domnul shi lji-ashtearsi cicioarili a lui cu perlji a ljei di cap, iarã fratili a ljei, Lazaru eara lãndzit. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Trã atsea surãrili lji pitricurã zbor al Isus dzãcãnda: “Doamne, ia, atsel tsi tini lu vrei, easti niputut.” <verse eid="JHN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Sh-Isusul, cum avdzã aesti, dzãsi: “Atsea lãngoari nu easti ti moarti, ma ti mãrirea a Dumnidzãlui, tsi prit ea s-multumãreascã Hiljilu a Dumnidzãlui.” <verse eid="JHN 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Isusul u vrea Marta, sora a ljei Maria sh-Lazarul. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Cãndu avdzã cã Lazarul eara lãndzit, armasi ninga doauã dzãli tu loclu iu eara. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Deapoea, dupã aestã, lã dzãsi a ucenitsilor: “S-nã turnãm napoi tu Iudea.” <verse eid="JHN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Ucenitsilji lji-dzãsirã: “Rabbi, deaneavra ti cãfta Iudeilji s-ti vãtãma cu chetri sh-tini ma ti duts nãpoi aclo?” <verse eid="JHN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Isusul apãndisi: “Nu suntu vahi doisprãdzatsi orili a dzuãljei? Macã vãrã imnã dzua, nu s-ncheadicã, cã veadi prit lunjina aishtei lumi. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Ma macã vãrã imnã noaptea, s-ncheadicã, cã lunjina nu easti tu nãsu.” <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Dupã tsi li dzãsi aesti zboari, adãvgã: “Oaspili a nostru, Lazaru lu ari acãtsat somnu, ma mini ma mi duc s-lu dishteptu.” <verse eid="JHN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Atumtsea ucenitsilji a lui lji dzãsirã: “Doamne, ma s-doarmã, va s-vindicã.” <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Ma Isusul lã-avea zburãtã trã moartea a lui, iarã elji minduirã cã Isusul avea zburãtã trã durnjirea. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Atumtsea Isusul lã dzãsi a lor discljis: “Lazarul muri. <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />Sh-mini mi hãrsescu trã voi cã nu earam aclo tra s-pistipsits, ma haidets s-nã dutsem la nãsu.” <verse eid="JHN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Atumtsea Toma, acljimatã Dzeaminu, lã dzãsi alãntor ucenitsi: “S-nã dutsem sh-noi, s-murim cu nãsu.” <verse eid="JHN 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Cãndu vini Isusul, lu aflã Lazarul di patru dzãli tu murmintu. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Ma Betania eara tsinsprãdzatsi di stadi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tsinsprãdzatsi di stadi easti 3 kilometri</char></note>aproapi di Ierusalem. <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Sh-multsã di Iudei avea vinit la Marta sh-la Maria trã lishurari durearea ti fratili a lor. <verse eid="JHN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Marta, cum avdzã cã ma yinea Isusul, lji-ishi nãinti. Iarã Maria shidea la casã. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Atumtsea Marta lji-dzãsi al Isus: “Doamne, ma s-earai aoa, fratili a meu nu va s-avea moartã, <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />ma sh-tora shtiu cã tuti atseali tsi lji caftsã a Dumnidzãlui, elu va tsã li da.” <verse eid="JHN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Isusul lji dzãsi: “Fratili a tãu va s-nyeadzã!” <verse eid="JHN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Marta lji apãndãsi: “Shtiu cã va s-nyeadzã tu nyeari, tu dzua di soni.” <verse eid="JHN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Isusul lji dzãsi: “Mini escu nyearea sh-bana. Cai pistipseashti la mini, va s-bãneadzã, sh-macã va s-moarã. <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />Sh-caitsido tsi bãneadzã shi pistipseashti tu mini, nu va s-moarã pute tu etã. Pistipseashti tini tu aestã?” <verse eid="JHN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Ea lji dzãsi: “Ie, Doamne, mini pistipsescu cã tini eshti Hristolu, Hiljilu a Dumnidzãlui, tsi yini tu lumi.” <verse eid="JHN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Sh-cum dzãsi ashã, s-dusi s-acljeamã pri ascumtu Maria, sora a ljei, dzãcãnda: “Nvitsãtorlu easti aoa sh-ma ti acljeami.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Macãt Maria avdzã, ea si sculã trãoarã shi vini la elu. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Ma Isusul ninga nu avea agiumtã tu hoarã, meti s-afla tu loclu iu Marta lji avea ishitã nãinti. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Atumtsea Iudeilji tsi eara cu Maria la casã, trã dari curaiu, cãndu vidzurã cã ea si sculã trãoarã shi ishi, s-dusirã dupã nãsã, dzãcãnda: “Ea ma s-dutsi la murmintu tra s-plãngã aclo.” <verse eid="JHN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Cãndu Maria vini la loclu iu s-afla Isusul sh-lu vidzu, lji cãdzu la cicioari dzãcãnda: “Doamne, ma s-earai tini aoa, fratili a meu nu va avea murit.” <verse eid="JHN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Isusul, cãndu u-vidzu plãngãnda sh-Iudeilji tsi avea vinit cu nãsã tutashã plãndzea, suschirã tu duh shi s-tulburã, <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />sh-ntribã: “Iu lu avets bãgatã?” Elji lji dzãsirã: “Doamne, haidi s-vedz!” <verse eid="JHN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Isusul s-lãcrimã. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Atumtsea Iudeilji dzãsirã: “Videts, cãt lu vrea!” <verse eid="JHN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Ma niscãntsã di elji dzãsirã: “Aestu tsi lji discljisi ocljilji a orbului, nu putea s-fãtsea tsiva tsi sh-aestu s-nu murea?” <verse eid="JHN 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Trã atsea Isusul suschirãnda napoi di nãuntru, vini la murmintu. Aestã eara unã pishtireauã sh-avea nãinti unã cheatrã. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Isusul dzãsi: “Mutats-u cheatra!” Marta, sora a mortului, lji-dzãsi: “Doamne, elu tora amputi, cã ari patru dzãli.” <verse eid="JHN 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Isusul lji dzãsi: “Nu tsã dzãsh cã ma s-pistipseashti, va s-vedz mãrirea a Dumnidzãlui?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Atumtsea elji u scularã cheatra di murmintu, sh-Isusul sculã ocljilji nsus dzãcãnda: “Tate, ti hãristisescu cã mi ascultash. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Mini u shtiam cã tini totãna mi ascultsã, ma li am dzãsã aesti trã itia a multsãmiljei tsi easti anvãrliga, tra s-pistipseascã cã tini mi pitricush.” <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Shi, dupã tsi dzãsi aesti, grãi cu boatsi analtã: “Lazar, easã nafoarã!” <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Atumtsea mortul ishi, cu mãnjili shi cicioarili ligati cu fãshi di pãndzã sh-fatsa anvãrtitã cu unã pitsetã. Isusul lã dzãsi a lor: “Dizligats-lu sh-alãsats-lu s-imnã!”<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Planlu ti Vãtãmari Isusul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Atumtsea multsã di Iudeilji, tsi avea vinitã la Maria sh-avea vidzut atsea tsi avea faptã Isusul, pistipsirã la nãsu. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Ma niscãntsã di elji s-dusirã la Fariseilji sh-lã spusirã a lor tsi avea faptã Isusul. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Atumtsea arhipreftsãlji sh-Fariseilji adunarã sinedriul sh-dzãsirã: “Tsi s-fãtsem? Aestu om ma fatsi multi seamni. <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Ma s-lu alãsãm ashãtsi, tuts va s-pistipseascã tu nãsu, sh-va s-yinã Romanjlji sh-va s-aspargã templu sh-fara a noastrã.” <verse eid="JHN 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Ma unu di elji, Caiafa, cai eara arhipreftul atsilui an, lã dzãsi a lor: “Voi nu aduchits tsiva! <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Sh-nitsi nu minduits cã easti ma ghini trã noi tra s-moarã un om trã populu, dicãt s-chearã tut fara.” <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Aestã elu nu u-dzãsi di mintea a lui, ma cã eara arhipreftul atsilui an sh-prufitipsi cã Isusul prindi s-murea ti fara a Iudeilor, <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />sh-nu mash ti fara, ma shi s-li adunã tu un, hiljilji a Dumnidzãlui tsi eara scurpisits. <verse eid="JHN 11:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Di tu atsea dzuã, elji apofãsirã s-lu vatãmã. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Trã atsea Isusul nu imna ma namisa di Iudeilji, ma s-dusi tu un loc aproapi di shcretuiri, tu un cãsãbã tsi s-acljima Efraim shi aclo stãtea cu ucenitsilji a lui. <verse eid="JHN 11:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Pashtili a Iudeilor eara aproapi sh-multsã oaminji di atsea parti s-alinarã tu Ierusalem trã curari nãintea a Pashtiljei. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Elji lu cãfta Isusul, shi stãnda tu templu, dzãtsea cu un-alantu: “Cum vã si pari a voauã? Va yinã elu tu sãrbãtoari?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Ma arhipreftsãlji shi Fariseilji avea datã ordin cã ma s-lu shtia vãrã iu eara elu, s-hãbãrsea shi s-lu acãtsa.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s1">Isusul Aumtu tu Betania</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Isusul shasi dzãli nãinti di Pashti vini tu Betania, iu bãna Lazarul, atsel tsi avea murit sh-Isusul lu avea nyeat dit mortsã. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Sh-aclo lji adrarã unã tsina. Marta chirnãsea, iarã Lazarul eara unu di atselji tsi shidea la measã cu Isusul. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Atumtsea Maria lo un litru di untulem di bunã-njurizmã di nardu curat sh-multu scumpu. Aumsi cicioarili al Isus shi lji ashtearsi cicioarili a lui cu perlu a ljei. Casa s-umplu cu njiurizma a njirlui. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Atumtsea un di ucenitsilji a lui, Iuda Iscariotul, atsel tsi va lu vindea, dzãsi: <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />“Cãtse nu s-vindu njirlu aestu cu trei suti di denari<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">trei suti di denari easti paga di un an</char></note> shi si s-dea a oarfãnjlor?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Ma aestã u dzãsi, nu cã s-minduea di oarfãnjlji, ma cã eara fur. Elu avea punga di pãradzi shi loa di atsea tsi s-bãga nãuntru. <verse eid="JHN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Isusul dzãsi: “Alãsats-u. Ea u ari vigljeatã ti dzua a ngrupariljei a mea. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Oarfãnjlji lji-avets totãna cu voi, ma mini nu va mi avets totãna.” <verse eid="JHN 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Atumtsea unã multsãmi mari di Iudei nvitsã cã Isusul eara aclo, sh-vini nu mash di nãsu, ma shi s-videa Lazarul, tsi elu lu-avea nyeatã dit mortsã. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Atumtsea arhipreftsãlji apofãsirã s-lu vatãmã sh-Lazarul, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />cã di itia a lui, multsã di Iudeilji ma fudzea sh-pistipsea la Isusul.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Yini tu Ierusalem ca Amirã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Alantã dzuã, unã multsãmi mari tsi avea vinit la sãrbãtoari, cãndu avdzã cã Isusul ma yinea tu Ierusalem, <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />loarã dedzi di palmã shi lji ishirã nãinti s-lu ashtipta aurlãnda:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">“Hosana! Ghinicuvintat atsel tsi yini tu numa a Domnului, Amirãlu al Israel!”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25-26">Ps 118:25-26</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Isusul aflã un gumãric shi ncãlicã pri nãsu, cum easti scriatã:<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />“S-nu ai fricã, populu a Sionlui, ia, amirãlu a tãu ma yini ncãlicat pri un cãriciu di gumarã!”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Zac 9:9</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Tu ahurhitã ucenitsilji a lui nu li-aduchirã aesti, ma, cãndu Isusul eara multumãritã, atumtsea adusirã aminti cã aesti eara scriati trã nãsu, sh-cã lji avea faptã aesti trã nãsu. <verse eid="JHN 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Ashãtsi multsãmea, tsi eara cu nãsu cãndu elu lu avea acljimat nafoarã Lazarul di tu murmintu, sh-lu avea nyeatã dit mortsã, dãdea dipriunã mãrtirii trã atsea. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Trã atsea sh-multsãmea lji-ishi nãinti, cã avea avdzãtã cã elu avea faptã aestã thavmã. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Atumtsea Fariseilji dzãsirã cu un-alantu: “Videts, cã nu putets s-fãtsets tsiva? Ia, lumea s-dutsi dupã nãsu.”<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Prispuni Moartea a Lui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Namisa di atselji tsi eara alinatã ti ncljinari tu sãrbãtoari eara sh-niscãntsã Elinji. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Elji s-apruchearã di Filipul, tsi eara di Betsaida a Galileiljei shi s-rugarã dzãcãnda: “Doamne, vrem s-videm Isusul.” <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Filipul vini sh-lji dzãsi al Andrea. Apoea Andrea sh-Filipul lji dzãsirã al Isus. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Ma Isusul lã-apãndisi a lor: “Ari vinit oara, tsi Hiljilu a Omlui va si s-multumãreascã. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Dealihea ma vã dzãc, macã gãrnutslu a grãnui cãdzut tu loc, nu moari, atsel armãni singur. Ma, macã moari, da multu carpo. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Cai u va bana a lui, va u chearã, sh-cai u aurashti bana a lui tu aestã dunjauã, va u veaglji tu bana di totãna. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Sh-macã vãrã mi huzmitipseashti, s-mi urmeadzã. Iu escu mini, aclo va hibã sh-huzmichearlu a meu. Macã vãrã mi huzmitipseashti, Tatãl va lu tinjiseascã. <verse eid="JHN 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />Tora suflitlu a meu easti tulburat, sh-tsi s-dzãc: ‘Tate mi ascapã di aestã oarã’? Ma trã atsea vinj tu aestã oarã. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Tate, multumãrea numa a ta!” Atumtsea unã boatsi vini dit tser: “U am multumãrit sh-napoi va-u multumãrescu!” <verse eid="JHN 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Multsãmea tsi eara aclo avdza sh-dzãtsea cã eara un bumbunidzari. Altsã dzãtsea: “Un anghil lj-grãi.” <verse eid="JHN 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Isusul apãndisi: “Boatsea aestã nu ari vinit ti mini, ma ti voi. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Tora easti giudicata aishtei lumi. Tora va si s-arucã nafoarã domnitorlu aishtei lumi! <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Sh-mini, cãndu va hiu anãltsat nsus dit loc, va li trag tuts cãtrã mini.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Elu li dzãtsea aesti tra sã spunea cã di tsi soi di moarti va s-murea. <verse eid="JHN 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Multsãmea lji apãndisi: “Noi avem avdzãtã di legea cã Hristolu armãni di totãna. Tora cum pots s-dzãts tini cã Hiljilu a Omlui prindi si s-analtsã nsus? Cai easti aestu ‘Hiljilu a Omlui’?” <verse eid="JHN 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Atumtsea Isusul lã dzãsi a lor: “Lunjina easti cu voi ninga putsãn chiro, imnats pãnã cãndu avets lunjinã, tsi s-nu vã acatsã scutidlu. Cai imnã tu scutidi nu shtii iu neadzi. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Pãnã cãndu avem lunjinã, s-lji pistipsits a lunjinãljei, tsi s-vã fãtsets hiljilji a lunjinãljei.” Cãndu Isusul dzãsi aesti, s-dipãrtã shi s-ascumsi di elji.<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pistipsirea sh-Nipistipsirea Namisa di Iudeilji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Ma cu tuti cã avea faptã multi thavmati nãintea a lor, elji nu pistipsea la nãsu, <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />tra si mplineascã zborlu a prufitlui Isaia tsi dzãsi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">“Doamne, cai lji-ari pistipsitã a predicariljei a noastrã? Sh-a cui lji si discupiri bratslu a Domnului?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Isa 53:1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Trã atsea elji nu putea s-pistipsea, cã cum Isaia nãpoi dzãsi:<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />“Li ari urghitã ocljilji a lor sh-li ari nchitritã ininjli a lor, tra s-nu veadã cu ocljilji, shi s-aducheascã cu ininjli, shi s-toarnã sh-mini s-li vindicã!”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:10">Isa 6:10</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Aesti dzãsi Isaia cãndu vidzu mãrirea al Isus sh-grãi trã elu. <verse eid="JHN 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Cu tutã atsea, sh-namisa di mãrlji, multsã pistipsirã la elu. Ma trã itia a Fariseilor, elji nu mãrtirsea ti Isusul, tra nu s-lji scutea di sinagogã, <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />cã vrurã alãvdarea a oaminjlor ma multu dicãt alãvdarea a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="JHN 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Ma Isusul grãi cu boatsi analtã, “Cai pistipseashti tu mini, nu pistipseashti mash tu mini, ma tu atsel tsi mi pitricu. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Sh-cai mi veadi mini, veadi atsel tsi mi pitricu. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Mini am vinit ca lunjinã tu lumi, tsi caitsido tsi pistipseashti tu mini s-nu armãnã tu scutidi. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Macã vãrã li avdã zboarili a meali sh-nu li veaglji, mini nu lu giudic, cã mini nu am vinit s-giudicã lumea, ma s-lu ascapã lumea. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Cai mi aleapid mini sh-nu li aproachi zboarili a meali, ari cai s-lu giudicã. Zborlu tsi am grãitã, aestu va lu giudicã dzua di soni. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Cã mini nu grãi di la mini, ma Tatãl tsi mi pitricu elu mi ari dimãndatã cã tsi prindi sã spun shi tsi sã zburãscu. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Mini u shtiu cã dimãndarea a lui adutsi banã eternã. Atseli tsi grãescu mini, li dzãc ashãtsi cum nji-li ari dzãsã Tatãl.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s1">Isusul Aspealã Cicioarili a Ucenitsilor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Eara nãinti di sãrbãtoarea a Pashtiljei. Isusul u shtia cã avea vinit oara a lui s-tritsea dit aestã dunjeauã cãtrã Tatãl. Elu lji vru oaminjlji a lui tsi eara tu lumi, sh-lji vru pãnã tu soni. <verse eid="JHN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Shi mãcãnda tsinã, draclu lj-avea bãgat tu inima al Iuda, hiljilu al Simon Iscariotul, tra s-lu vindea Isusul. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Isusul lu shtia cã Tatãl lji-li-avea datã tuti tu mãnã sh-cã elu avea ishit di la Dumnidzãlu sh-la Dumnidzãlu ma s-turna, <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />si sculã di la tsinã, bãgã dinãparti stranjili shi lo un pischir, sh-lu lãgã tu mesi anvãrliga di nãsu. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Atumtsea turnã apã tu unã vasi sh-ahurhi trã aspilari cicioarili a ucenitsilor, shi s-lã-li ashteargã cu pischiru tsi avea ligat tu mesi. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Vini la Simon Petrul sh-elu lji-dzãsi: “Doamne, tini s-nji aspelji cicioarili?” <verse eid="JHN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Isusul lj-apãndisi: “Atsea tsi ma fac mini, tini tora nu u-shtii, ma va u-aducheshti dupã aestã.” <verse eid="JHN 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Petrul lji dzãsi: “Pute nu va nji-li aspelji cicioarili!” Isusul lj-apãndisi: “Ca s-nu ts-li aspel, nu va s-ai parti cu mini.” <verse eid="JHN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Simon Petrul lji-dzãsi: “Doamne, nu mash cicioarili ma sh-mãnjili sh-caplu.” <verse eid="JHN 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Isusul lji-dzãsi: “Cai easti aspilat, nu ari ananghi dicãt s-aspealã cicioarili sh-easti tut curat. Shi voi hits curats, ma nu tuts.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Cã elu shtia cã cai va s-lu vindea sh-trã atsea dzãsi: “Nu hits tuts curats.” <verse eid="JHN 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Sh-dupã tsi aspilã-cicioarili a lor, lo napoi stranjili a lui, acãtsã loc la measã sh-lã ntribã: “Aduchits cã tsi vã am faptã? <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Voi mi acljimats ‘Nvitsãtor’ shi ‘Domnu’, sh-ghini dzãtsets cã escu. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Macã mini, Domnul shi Nvitsãtorlu, vã aspilai cicioarili a voauã sh-voi prindi s-aspilats cicioarili a unui-alantu. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Vã-am datã exemplu cã ashã cum vã am faptã mini a voauã, s-fãtsets sh-voi. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Dealihea ma vã dzãc, huzmichearlu nu easti ma mari dicãt nicuchirlu a lui, nitsi pitricutlu ma mari dicãt atsel tsi lu ari pitricut. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Tora tsi li shtits aesti lucri, ghinicuvintats va-hits voi, macã va li fãtsets.”<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Prispuni Pridarea a Lui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />“Nu ma grescu ti voi tuts. Mini shtiu cai am aleaptã. Ma aestã s-fatsi tra si mplineascã Scritura: ‘Atsel tsi mãcã pãni cu mini, sculã cãlcãnjilu contra mini.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Ma vã dzãc di tora, nãinti tsi s-undzeascã, cã, cãndu s-undzeascã, voi s-pistipsits cã mini escu. <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Dealihea ma vã dzãc, cai aproachi atsel tsi am pitricut mini, mi aproachi mini. Cai mi aproachi mini, aproachi atsel tsi mi ari pitricut.” <verse eid="JHN 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Dupã tsi li dzãsi aesti, Isusul s-tulburã tu duh sh-mãrtirsi: “Dealihea ma vã dzãc cã un di voi va mi prida.” <verse eid="JHN 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Atumtsea ucenitsilji videa un-alantu shi eara ciudisits cã di cai ma zbura. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Un di ucenitsilji a lui, tsi Isusul lu vrea, eara ndupirat tu cheptul al Isus. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Atumtsea Simon Petrul lji-featsi semnu a uceniclui tra s-lu ntriba cã cai eara atsel trã cai grãi. <verse eid="JHN 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Ma elu aplicãnda tu cheptul al Isus, lu-ntribã: “Doamne, cai easti?” <verse eid="JHN 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Isusul lji-apãndisi: “Easti atsel a cui mini va lji-u dau mãshcãtura di pãni, dupã tsi s-u am muljeatã.” Sh-u mulje mãshcãtura sh-lji-u deadi al Iuda, hiljilu al Simon Iscariotul. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Sh-dupã tsi lo mãshcãtura di pãni, atumtsea intrã Satanlu tu nãsu. Atumtsea Isusul lji-dzãsi: “Tsi ai ti fãtseari, fã-u trãoarã!” <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Ma vãrã di atselji tsi eara la measã nu aduchi, cãtse Isusul lji-u-dzãsi atsilui aestã. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Niscãntsã minduea cã, metsi Iuda tsãnea punga di pãradzi, Isusul lji avea dzãsã: “Acumpãrã tsi nã hãrzãeashti di sãrbãtoari”, icã s-lã dãdea tsiva a niavutslor. <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Elu dupã tsi lo mãshcãtura, ishi afoarã trãoarã. Eara noapti.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Prispuni Alipidarea di la Petru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Ma cãndu ishi Iuda, Isusul dzãsi: “Tora Hiljilu a Omlui easti multumãrit sh-Dumnidzãlu easti multumãrit tu nãsu. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Macã Dumnidzãlu easti multumãrit tu nãsu, Dumnidzãlu va s-lu multumãreascã Hiljilu tu nãsu, sh-va lu multumãreascã trãoarã. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Hiljilji a melji, ninga putsãn escu cu voi. Voi va mi cãftats, sh-ashã cum lã am dzãsã a Iudeilor, ashãtsi tora ma vã dzãc sh-a voauã: Aclo iu mi duc mini voi nu putets s-yinits.<verse eid="JHN 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Ma vã dau unã dimãndari noauã: s-vã vrets cu un-alantu! Ashã cum mini vã am vrut, ashã sh-voi s-vã vrets cu un-alantu. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Di aestã va vã cunoascã tuts cã hits ucenitsilji a melji, macã avets vreari unu cu-alantu.” <verse eid="JHN 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Simon Petrul lu ntribã: “Doamne, iu ti duts?” Isusul lji-apãndisi: “Aclo iu mi duc mini, tini nu pots s-mi urmedzi tora, ma, ma amãnat va mi urmeshti.” <verse eid="JHN 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Petrul lji-dzãsi: “Doamne, cãtse nu pot s-ti-urmescu tora? Mini va u-dau bana a mea trã tini.” <verse eid="JHN 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Isusul lji-apãndisi: “Tini va s-u alash bana a ta trã mini? Dealihea ma tsã-dzãc, cucotlu nu va s-cãntã, pãnã cãndu tini mi aleapidz di trei ori.”<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s1">Isusul Diznjirdã Ucenitsilji a Lui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />“S-nu s-cutreamburã inima a voastrã. Pistipsits tu Dumnidzã sh-pistipsits tu mini! <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Tu casa a Tatãlui a meu ari multi locuri, altã soi va vã dzãtseam. Ma mi duc s-vã ndregu un loc. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Sh-cãndu s-mi duc s-vã ndregu un loc, va s-mi tornu napoi sh-va vã-ljeau ningã mini, tsi aclo iu escu mini s-hits sh-voi. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Voi u-shtits calea cã iu ma mi duc mini.”<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Easti Calea cãtrã Tatãl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Toma lj-dzãsi: “Doamne, noi nu shtim iu ti duts. Cum putem s-u shtim calea?” <verse eid="JHN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Isusul lj-dzãsi: “Mini escu calea, alihea sh-bana. Vãrã nu yini la Tatãl dicãt mash prit mini. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Ma s-mi aveat cunuscut, va s-aveat cunuscut sh-Tatãl a meu. Di tora lu cunushtets sh-lu avets vidzut.” <verse eid="JHN 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Filipul lj-dzãsi: “Doamne, spuni-nã Tatãl sh-easti nimal.” <verse eid="JHN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Isusul lj-apãndisi: “Di-ahãntu chiro tsi escu cu voi, sh-tini ninga nu mi ai cunuscut, Filipe? Cai mi ari vidzut mini, ari vidzut Tatãl. Cum pots s-dzãts: ‘Spuni-nã Tatãl’? <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Nu pistipseashti cã mini escu tu Tatãl sh-Tatãl easti tu mini? Zboarili tsi ma vã dzãc, nu li dzãc di la mini. Tatãl tsi bãneadzã tu mini, elu lã fatsi faptili. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Pistipsits-mi cã mini escu tu Tatãl sh-Tatãl easti tu mini! Ca s-nu pistipsits la mini, pistipsits trã faptili a meali. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Dealihea ma vã dzãc, cai pistipseashti tu mini va s-facã sh-elu faptili tsi fac mini, sh-va s-facã sh-ma mãri di aesti, cã mini ma mi duc la Tatãl. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Sh-itsido tsi va cãftats tu numa a mea, va-u fac, tsi Tatãl s-multumãreascã di la Hiljilu. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Macã va s-cãftats tsiva tu numa a mea, mini va-u fac.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tãxirea a Duhlui Sãmtu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />Macã mi vrets, vigljeats dimãndãrili a meali. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Mini va lji fac rigeai a Tatãlui sh-elu va vã da un Diznjirdãtor altu, tra s-armãnã di totãna cu voi, <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Duhlu a Alihiljei, tsi lumea nu poati s-lu ljea, cã nu-l veadi sh-nu-l cunoashti. Ma voi lu cunushtets, cã sta cu voi sh-va hibã tu voi. <verse eid="JHN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />Nu va s-vã alasã oarfãnji, va mi tornu la voi. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Ninga putsãn sh-lumea nu va mi veadã ma, ma voi va s-mi videts. Cã mini bãnedz shi voi va s-bãnats. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Atsea dzuã va s-cunushtets cã mini escu tu Tatãl a meu, sh-voi tu mini shi mini tu voi. <verse eid="JHN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />Cai ari dimãndãrili a meali sh-li veaglji, easti atsel tsi mi va. Cai mi va mini, va hibã vrut di Tatãl a meu, sh-mini va lu voi sh-va mi aspun a lui.” <verse eid="JHN 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Iuda, (nu Iuda Iscariotul) lu-ntribã: “Doamne, cum va s-ti aspunji a noauã, shi nu a lumiljei?” <verse eid="JHN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Isusul lj-apãndisi: “Macã vãrã mi va, sh-va veaglji zborlu a meu, Tatãl a meu va lu va, sh-noi va s-yinim la elu sh-va s-bãnãm cu nãsu. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Cai nu mi va, nu li veaglji zboarili a meali. Zboarili tsi ma avdzãts nu suntu a meali, ma a Tatãlui tsi mi ari pitricut. <verse eid="JHN 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />Vã li-am dzãsã aesti, cara escu cu voi, <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />ma Diznjirdãtorlu, Duhlu Sãmtu, tsi Tatãl va s-lu pitreac tu numa a mea, elu va s-vã nveatsã itsido sh-va s-vã aducã aminti tuti aesti tsi vã dzãsh. <verse eid="JHN 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />Pace ma vã alasã, pacea a mea ma vã-u dau. Mini vã-u dau, ma nu cum vã-u da lumea. Inima a voastrã s-nu si s-tulburã sh-nu s-asparã. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Voi avets avdzãtã cã mini vã am dzãsã: ‘Mini ma mi duc sh-va mi tornu la voi.’ Ma s-mi vrets, va s-vã hãrsits cã mini dzãsh: ‘Ma mi duc la Tatãl’, cã Tatãl a meu easti ma mari di mini. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Vã-am dzãsã tora, ma nãinti tra s-undzeascã, tsi cãndu s-undzeascã, s-pistipsits. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Nu va s-grãiescu di ma multi cu voi, cã ma yini domnitorlu a lumiljei aishtei. Elu nu ari puteari pristi mini. <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />Aestã s-fatsi tsi lumea s-cunoascã cã mini lu voi Tatãl sh-facã ashã cum Tatãl mi ari dimãndatã. Sculats-vã, s-fudzim di aoa!”<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yita sh-Dedzili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />“Mini escu yita alihioasã sh-Tatãl a meu easti ayinjearlu. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Itsi vlãstar tu mini, tsi nu da carpo elu l-talji, sh-itsi vlãstar tsi da carpo elu u ndreadzi tra s-da ma multu carpo. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Voi tora hits chischinji, trã itia a zborlui tsi vã dzãsh. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Armãnets tu mini sh-mini tu voi. Vãrã vlãstar nu poati s-da carpo di la nãsu, ca s-nu armãnã tu yitã, ashã sh-voi nu dats carpo macã nu armãnets tu mini. <verse eid="JHN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />Mini escu yita, voi hits vlãstãrili. Cai armãni tu mini sh-mini tu nãsu, atsel da multu carpo, cã fãrã di mini nu putets s-fãtsets tsiva. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Macã vãrã nu armãni tu mini, s-arucã nafoarã ca vlãstarlu shi s-usucã. Deapoea li adunã, sh-li arucã tu foc tra s-ardã. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Macã armãnets tu mini shi zboarili a meali armãn tu voi, cãftats tsi s-vrets sh-va vã si fac. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Tatãl a meu easti multumãrit tu aestã, tra s-dutsets multu carpo shi s-vã fãtsets ucenitsilji a melji. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Ashã cum Tatãl mi ari vrut mini, ashã sh-mini vã am vrut voi. Tora armãnets tu vrearea a mea. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Ma s-vigljeats dimãndãrili a meali, va s-armãnets tu vrearea a mea, ashã di-cum mini vigljeai dimãndãrili a Tatãlui a meu sh-armãn tu vrearea a lui. <verse eid="JHN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />Aesti vã li spush tsi haraua a mea s-armãn tu voi sh-haraua a voastrã s-hibã ntreagã. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Aestã easti dimãndarea a mea: S-vã vrets cu un-alantu, ashã cum mini vã am vrut voi. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Vãrã nu ari vreari ma mari di aestã: S-da bana trã oaspitslji a lui. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Voi hits oaspitslji a melji, macã fãtsets itsido tsi mini vã dimãndu. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Mini nu vã acljem ma huzmicheari, cã huzmichearlu nu shti tsi fatsi nicuchirlu. Ma mini vã am acljimat oaspits, cã vã feciu s-cunushtets tuti tsi avdzãi di la Tatãl a meu. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Nu mi aleapsit voi mini, ma mini vã alepshu voi, sh-vã bãgai s-vã dutsets shi s-dats frut, shi frutlu a vostru s-armãnã. Itsido tsi va lji cãftats a Tatãlui tu numa a mea, elu va s-vã da. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Aestã vã-ursescu: S-vã vrets cu un-alantu.”<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lumea Aurashti Ucenitsilji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />“Macã lumea vã aurashti, sã shtits cã ma nãinti mi ari auratã mini. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Ma s-earat dit lumea, lumea va vã vrea ca a ljei. Trã atsea cã nu hits dit lumi, mini vã alepshu dit lumi, sh-trã aestã itii lumea vã aurashti. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Adutsets aminti zborlu tsi mini vã dzãsh: ‘Huzmichearlu nu easti ma mari dicãt nicuchirlu a lui.’ Macã mi au avinatã mini, va s-vã avinã sh-voi. Macã vigljearã nvitsãtura a mea, va u-veaglji shi nvitsãtura a voastrã. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Tuti aesti va vã li facã trã itia a numãljei a mea, cã nu cunoscu atsel tsi mi ari pitricut. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Ma s-nu aveam yinit shi s-nu lã aveam grãit a-lor, nu va avea cãbati ti amãrtiili. Ma tora elji nu au ljirtari di amãrtiili a lor. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Cai mi aurashti mini, aurashti sh-Tatãl a meu. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Ma s-nu aveam adratã la elji faptili tsi vãrã altu nu li featsi, nu va s-avea cãbati ti amãrtiili. Ma tora au vidzut, shi mi au auratã sh-mini sh-Tatãl a meu <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Ma aestã undzi tra si mplineascã zborlu scriatã tu Legea a lor: ‘Mi au auratã fãrã itii.’ ”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 35:19">Ps 35:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:4">69:4</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lucrul al Duhlu Sãmtu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />“Ma cãndu s-yinã Diznjirdãtorlu, tsi va s-vã pitrec di la Tatãl, Duhlu a alihiljei, tsi easi di la Tatãl, elu va s-mãrtirseascã trã mini. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Sh-voi, tutashã, prindi s-mãrtirsits, cã earat cu mini di tu apãrnjitã.”<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />“Vã li-am dzãsã aesti lucri, tra s-nu vã dipãrtats di pisti. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Va s-vã scoatã dit sinagodzãli sh-ma yini oara tsi, caitsido tsi va s-vã vatãmã, va s-mindueascã cã elu fatsi lucrul a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Sh-va vã li fac aesti lucri, cã nu lu au cunuscutã nitsi Tatãl, nitsi mini. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Ma mini vã li am dzãsã aesti tsi, cãndu s-yinã oara a lor, s-vã adutsets aminti cã mini vã li-am dzãsã. Nu vã li dzãsh di tu apãrnjitã, cã earam cu voi. <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Ma tora mini ma mi duc la atsel tsi mi pitricu. Vãrã di voi nu ma mi-ntreabã: ‘Iu ti duts?’ <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Sh-trã atsea cã vã aspush aesti, nvirinarea u-ari umplut inima a voastrã. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Cu-tutã-atsea, mini vã spunã alihea: easti ma ghini trã voi tsi mini s-mi duc, cã, ma s-nu mi duc, nu va s-yinã la voi Diznjirdãtorlu. Macã mini mi duc, mini va lu pitrec. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Cãndu s-aibã yinitã, elu va u-cãndãrseascã lumea di amãrtii, di ndriptati sh-di giudicatã. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Di amãrtii cã nu pistipsescu tu mini, <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />di ndriptati, cã mini ma mi duc la Tatãl, sh-nu va s-mi videts ma, <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />sh-di giudicatã, cã domnitorlu a lumiljei aishtei tora easti giudicat. <verse eid="JHN 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />Am sh-ma multi trã spuneari a voauã, ma tora voi nu putets s-li tsãnets. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Ma, cãndu s-yinã elu, Duhlu a alihiljei, va s-vã ndripteadzã la tutã alihea. Elu nu va s-greascã di-la nãsu, ma va s-greascã atsea tsi va s-avdã sh-va s-vã aspunã atseli tsi va s-yinã. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Elu va mi multumãreascã, cã va ljea di atsea a mea sh-va s-vã-u dimãndã. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Tuti cãti ari Tatãl suntu a meali. Trã-atsea vã dzãsh cã Duhlu va ljea di a mea sh-va s-vã-u dimãndã a voauã.”<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ucenitsilji au Ntribãri trã Fudzirea al Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />“Ninga niheamã sh-nu va mi videts ma. Dupã putsãn chiro va mi videts nãpoi.” <verse eid="JHN 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Atumtsea niscãntsã di ucenitsilji a lui dzãtsea cu un-alantu: “Tsi easti aestã tsi ma nã dzãtsi: ‘Ninga putsãn sh-nu va mi videts, sh-iarã dupã putsãn chiro mini va s-mi videts,’ shi: ‘Cã mini ma mi duc la Tatãl?’” <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Elji ntriba dipriunã: “Tsi easti aestã ‘putsãn’, di cai zburashti? Noi nu shtim tsi zburashti.” <verse eid="JHN 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Isusul aduchi cã vrurã s-ntriba shi lã dzãsi a-lor: “Voi ma ntribats un-alantu cãtse dzãsh: ‘Ninga niheamã sh-nu va mi videts ma, sh-ninga niheamã va s-mi videts nãpoi’? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Dealihea, mini ma vã dzãc cã va s-plãndzets sh-va s-vãitats, ma lumea va s-hãrseascã. Voi va s-vã nvirinats ma amãreatsa a voastrã va s-toarnã tu harauã. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Muljearea, cãndu amintã, ari dureari, cã yini oara a ljei. Ma dupã tsi amintã cilimeanlu, nu ma adutsi aminti munduirea, di haraua tsi s-amintã un om tu lumi. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Ashãtsi-shi voi tora avets amãreatsã, ma mini va s-vã ved nãpoi sh-inima a voastrã va s-hãrseascã, sh-vãrã nu va u ljea haraua a voastrã di la voi. <verse eid="JHN 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />Sh-tu atsea dzuã voi nu va mi ntribats ma di tsiva. Dealihea ma vã dzãc, cã itsido tsi s-lji cãftats a Tatãlui tu numa a mea, elu va vã-u da. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Pãnã tora voi nu avets cãftatã tsiva tu numa a mea. Cãftats sh-va s-loats, tsi haraua a voastrã s-hibã ntreagã. <verse eid="JHN 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />Vã li-am dzãsã aesti lucri tu paraboli, ma ma yini oara cãndu nu va s-vã grescu ma cu paraboli, ma va s-vã grescu discljisã ti Tatãl. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Tu atsea dzuã voi va s-cãftats tu numa a mea, sh-nu ma dzãc cã mini va s-lji fac rigeai a Tatãlui trã voi. <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />Tatãl idyiul vã va, cã voi mi vrut mini sh-avets pistipsit cã mini am ishit di la Dumnidzãlu. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Mini ishi di la Tatãl sh-vinj tu lumi, tora ma u alasã lumea sh-ma mi ducã la Tatãl.” <verse eid="JHN 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Ucenitsilji a lui lji dzãsirã: “Ia, tini tora ma zburashti discljis sh-nu ma foloseshti nitsi-unã parabolã. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Tora noi aduchim cã tini li shtii tuti sh-nu ai ananghi tsi vãrã s-ti ntreabã. Trã atsea noi pistipsim, cã ai ishit di la Dumnidzãlu.” <verse eid="JHN 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Isusul apãndisi a-lor: “Tora pistipsits voi? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Ia, ma yini ora sh-tora ari vinitã, tsi voi va vã arãspãndits cathiun tu casa a lui. Voi va mi alãsats singur, ma mini nu escu singur, cã Tatãl easti cu mini. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Vã li dzãsh aeasti tra s-u avets pacea tu mini. Tu lumi va s-avets munduiri, ma loats curaiu, cã mini u nichisii lumea!”<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s1">Isusul s-Roagã tra s-Multumãreascã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Cãndu Isusul dzãsi aesti, sculã ocljilji a lui cãtrã tser shi s-rugã: “Pãrinte, oara ari vinit. Multumãrea Hiljilu a tãu, tsi sh-Hiljilu a tãu s-ti multumãreascã. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Tini ai datã puteari pristi itsido om, tsi elu s-da banã eternã la tuts atselji tsi tini lj-ai datã. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Sh-aestã easti bana eternã, s-ti cunoascã tini singurlu Dumnidzã alihios, sh-Isus Hristos, tsi tini ai pitricut. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Mini ti am multumãritã pri loc, fãcãnda lucrul tsi nji ai datã s-lu fac. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Sh-tora, mi multumãrea Pãrinte ningã tini, cu mãrirea tsi mini u avui ningã tini nãinti tsi s-adra lumea.<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul s-Roagã trã Ucenitsilji a Lui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />Mini lji-u am aspusã numa a ta a oaminjlor tsi tini nji lji ai datã dit lumea. Eara a tãlji sh-tini nji lji ai datã, sh-elji lu au vigljeatã zborlu a tãu. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Tora elji au cunuscut cã itsido tsi tini nji ai datã yini di la tini, <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />cã lji-li am datã a lor zboarili tsi tini nji-li ai datã a njia, sh-elji li au aprucheatã sh-au cunuscutã cã dealihea mini ishi di la tini, sh-pistipsirã cã tini mi ai pitricut. <verse eid="JHN 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />Mini mi rog trã elji. Nu mi rog trã lumea, ma trã atselji tsi nji ai datã, cã suntu a tãlji. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Sh-tuti atseali a meali suntu a tali, sh-atseali a tali suntu a meali, sh-mini escu multumãritã prit nãshi. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Sh-mini nu escu ma tu lumi, iarã elji suntu tu lumi, sh-mini ma yin la tini. Pãrinte sãmtu, veagljili atselji cu putearea a numãljei a ta, atselji tsi nji ai datã, tra s-hibã un, ashã cum him sh-noi. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Cãndu earam cu elji mini lji am vigljeat sh-lji am apãrat tu numa tsi nj-ai datã. Vãrã di elji nu ari chirut, di cãt mash hiljilu a chireariljei tra si mplinea Scritura. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Sh-tora mini ma yin la tini shi li grescu aesti tu lumi, tsi elji s-u aibã haraua a mea ntreagã tu nãshi. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Mini lã am datã a-lor zborlu a tãu sh-lumea lji ari auratã, cã elji nu suntu dit lumi, ashã cum sh-mini nu escu di lumi. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Mini nu caftu tsi tini s-lji ljeai dit lumi, ma tsi s-lji veglji di arãulu. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Elji nu suntu a lumiljei, ashã cum sh-mini nu escu a lumiljei. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Sãmtsea-lji atselji tu alihea a ta. Zborlu a tãu easti alihea. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Ashã cum tini mi pitricushi tu lumi, tutashã sh-mini lji pitricui elji tu lumi. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Sh-trã itia a lor mi sãmtsãscu, tsi sh-elji s-hibã sãmtsãsits tu alihea.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul s-Roagã trã Tuts Pistimenjlji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />Tora mini nu mi rog mash di elji, ma sh-trã atselji tsi va s-pistipseascã tu mini prit zborlu a lor, <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />tsi tuts s-hibã unã, ashã cum tini, Pãrinte, eshti tu mini shi mini tu tini. Elji s-hibã unã tu noi, sh-lumea s-pistipseascã cã tini mi pitricushi. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Sh-mini lã am datã a lor mãrirea tsi tini nji ai datã, tsi elji s-hibã unã, ashã cum noi him unã. <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Mini escu tu elji sh-tini tu mini, tra s-hibã ntreagã tu unã. Atumtsea lumea va s-cunoascã tsi tini mi pitricushi shi lji vrushi atselji, ashã cum mi vrushi sh-mini.<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />Pãrinte, mini voi tsi aclo iu escu mini, s-hibã cu mini sh-atselji tsi nji ai datã, tra s-veadã mãrirea a mea tsi tini nji ai datã, cã tini mi vrushi ma nãinti di thimiljiusirea a lumiljei. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Pãrinte ndreptu, lumea nu ti ari cunuscut, iarã mini ti am cunuscut, sh-aeshti shtiu cã tini mi ai pitricut. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Sh-am faptã cunuscut numa a ta sh-va u-facã cunuscut tsi vrearea, cu cai tini mi vrushi mini s-hibã tu elji shi mini tu elji.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s1">Isusul Ligat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Dupã tsi li dzãsi aesti, Isusul s-dusi cu ucenitsilji a lui napãrti a traplui Chedron, iu eara un gãrdinã tu cai intrã elu cu ucenitsilji a lui. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Iuda cai ma lu vindea, u shtia loclu, cã di multi ori Isusul s-aduna aclo cu ucenitsilji a lui. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Atumtsea, Iuda lo unã cohortã cu suldatsi sh-vigljitori di la arhipreftsãlji sh-di la Fariseilji, vini aclo cu fãnãri, lãmbãdzi sh-cu armi. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Atumtsea, Isusul shtinda itsido tsi va lji undzea, ishi sh-lã dzãsi a lor, “Cai cãftats?” <verse eid="JHN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Elji lji-apãndisirã, “Isus Nazareas.” Isusul lã dzãsi a lor: “Mini escu!” (Ma sh-Iuda tsi ma lu vindea eara cu elji.) <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Cãndu lã dzãsi a lor: “Mini escu,” elji s-nãpuirã sh-cãdzurã mpadi. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Atumtsea Isusul lã ntribã nãpoi: “Cai cãftats?” Elji dzãsirã: “Isus Nazareas.” <verse eid="JHN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Isusul lj-apãndisi: “Vã am dzãsã cã Mini escu. Trã atsea macã mi cãftats mini, alãsats-lji aeshti s-ducã.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Atsea s-featsi tra si mplineacã zborlu tsi avea dzãsã: “Nu chirui nitsiunu di atselji tsi nji-ai datã.” <verse eid="JHN 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Atumtsea Simon Petrul, tsi avea unã spatã, u scoasi shi agudi huzmichearlu a arhipreftlui sh-lji-u tãlje ureaclja atsea ndreapta. (Huzmichearlu s-acljima Malcu). <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Atumtsea Isusul lji dzãsi al Petru: “Bagã spata a ta tu seacã! Nu va s-u beau mini cupa tsi nj-ari datã Tatãl?” <verse eid="JHN 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Atumtsea cohorta a suldatsilor, cãpidanlu, sh-vigljitorlji a Iudeilor lu acãtsarã Isusul sh-lu ligarã. <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Deapoea lu dusirã ma nãinti la Anna, tsi eara socrul al Caiafa, arhipreftul a anlui atsilui. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Ma Caiafa eara atsel, tsi lji avea urnipsitã Iudeilji cã eara ghini tsi un om s-murea trã populu.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petrul Aleapid Isusul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Simon Petrul sh-un altu ucenic urma Isusul. Aestu ucenic eara cunuscutlu a arhipreftlui sh-intrã cu Isusul tu uborlu a arhipreftlui. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Petrul stãtu nafoarã la poartã. Atumtsea, uceniclu atsel alantu, tsi eara cunuscutlu a arhipreftlui, ishi sh-grãi cu purtãreasa sh-bãgã nãuntru Petrul. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Sh-huzmichearea purtãreasã lji-dzãsi a Petrului: “Nacã eshti sh-tini di ucenitsilji a omlui aishtui?” Elu dzãsi: “Nu escu.” <verse eid="JHN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Huzmichearlji sh-vigljitorlji avea apreasã un foc cu cãrbunji shi shãdea mproshtsã shi s-ncãldza, cã eara arcoari. Tutashã sh-Petrul shidea mprostu cu nãshi shi s-ncãldza.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Arhipreftul Ntreabi Isusul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Arhipreftul ntribã Isusul ti ucenitsilji a lui sh-ti nvitsãtura a lui. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Isusul lji-apãndisi a lui: “Mini lj-am zburãt discljis a lumiljei. Mini totãna am nvitsat tu sinagogã sh-tu templu, iu s-aduna Iudeilji sh-nu zburai tsiva pri ascumtu. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Trã tse mi ntreghi mini? Ntreabã atselji tsi au avdzãtã tsi lã zburai a lor. Ia, elji shtiu cã tsi am dzãsã mini.” <verse eid="JHN 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Dupã tsi li dzãsi aesti zboari, un di vigljitorlji tsi lji stãtea aproapi lu agudi Isusul cu palmã pri fatsã, dzãcãnda: “Ashã lj-apãndiseshti a arhipreftlui?” <verse eid="JHN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Isusul lji apãndisi: “Ma s-am zburãtã arãu, mãrtirsea, iu easti arãulu, ma, metsi am zburãtã ghini, cãtse mi agudeshti?” <verse eid="JHN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Atumtsea Anna lu pitricu ligat la Caiafa, arhipreftul. <verse eid="JHN 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Simon Petru stãtea aclo shi s-ncãldza. Elji lji dzãsirã, “Nacã eshti sh-tini di ucenitsilji a lui?” Elu alipidãnda dzãsi, “Nu escu.” <verse eid="JHN 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Un di huzmichearlji a arhipreftlui, tsi eara di soia a atsilui, a cui Petrul lji avea tãljiatã ureaclja, dzãsi: “Nu ti vidzui tu gãrdinã cu nãsu?” <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Shi Petrul lu alipidã nãpoi shi trãoarã cãntã cucotlu.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Nãintea al Pilat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Deapoea, dupã Caiafa lu dusirã Isusul tu pretorium sh-eara dimineatsa curundu. Elji nu intrarã tu pretorium tra s-nu s-pãnĝãneascã, ma s-poatã s-mãca Pashtili. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Atumtsea Pilatul ishi afoarã ningã elji shi dzãsi: “Tsi acuzã adutsets contra a omlui aishtui?” <verse eid="JHN 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Elji apãndisirã sh-lji dzãsirã: “Ma s-nu eara arãu-fãcãtor aestu nu va lu prideam la tini.” <verse eid="JHN 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Atumtsea Pilatul lã dzãsi a lor: “Loats-lu voi sh-giudicats-lu dupã legea a voastrã.” Ma Iudeilji lji dzãsirã: “A noauã nu nã easti datã ndreptul s-vãtãmãm vãrã.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Atsea undzi tra si mplineascã zborlu tsi avea dzãsã Isusul, cã cu tsi moarti va s-murea. <verse eid="JHN 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Atumtsea Pilatul intrã nãpoi tu pretorium, acljimã Isusul sh-lu ntribã, “Eshti tini amirãlu a Iudeilor?” <verse eid="JHN 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Isusul apãndisi, “Aestã u dzãtsi tini di la tini, icã ts-au dzãsã altsã trã mini?” <verse eid="JHN 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Pilatul lji apãndisi, “Escu mini vahi Iude? Fara a ta shi arhipreftsãlji ti prideadirã la mini. Tsi ai faptã?” <verse eid="JHN 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Isusul apãndisi, “Amirãriljea a mea nu easti dit aestã lumi. Ma s-eara amirãriljea a mea dit aestã lumi, huzmichearlji a melji va s-alumta tsi mini s-nu earam pridat la mãrlji a Iudeilor. Ma amirãriljea a mea nu easti di aoa.” <verse eid="JHN 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Atumtsea Pilatul lu ntribã, “Tini eshti amirã?” Isusul apãndisi, “Tini dzãtsi cã mini escu amirã. Trã atsea mini escu amintat sh-trã aestã am vinit tu lumi, tra s-mãrtirsescu trã alihea. Caitsido tsi easti dit alihea, ascultã boatsea a mea.” <verse eid="JHN 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Pilatul lji dzãsi, “Tsi easti alihea?” Sh-cum dzãsi aestã, ishi nãpoi ningã Iudeilji sh-lã dzãsi a-lor, “Mini nu ma aflã la nãsu vãrã cãbati! <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Ma la voi easti adetea tsi mini s-vã sãlãghescu un hãpsãnit ti Pashti. Vrets s-vã sãlãghescu amirãlu a Iudeilor?” <verse eid="JHN 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Atumtsea tuts aurlarã dzãcãnda: “Nu aestu, ma Baraba!” (Baraba eara un rebil).<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="s1">Isusul Condamnat Cu Crutsisiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Atumtsea Pilatul ursi s-ljea Isusul shi s-lu batã cu cãmciclu. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Suldatslji featsirã unã curunã di schinji, lji-u bãgarã n-cap sh-lu nviscurã cu un mantil di purpurã. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Elji yinea la elu sh-lji dzãtsea: “Salut, amirãlu a Iudeilor!” Sh-lu agudea cu pãlnji pri fatsã. <verse eid="JHN 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Deapoea Pilatul ishi nãpoi nafoarã sh-lã dzãsi a lor: “Ia, ma vã-lu aduc nafoarã tra s-videts cã nu aflu la nãsu nitsi unã cãbati.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Atumtsea Isusul ishi afoarã cu curuna di schinji n-cap sh-mantilul di purpurã. Pilatul lã-dzãsi a lor, “Ia, omlu!” <verse eid="JHN 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Cãndu lu vidzurã arhipreftsãlji sh-vigljitorlji a lor, aurlarã dzãcãnda: “Crutsisits-lu! Crutsisits-lu!” Pilatul lã dzãsi a lor: “Loats-lu voi sh-crutsisits-lu! Mini nu aflu la nãsu vãrã cãbati.” <verse eid="JHN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Mãrlji a Iudeilor apãndisirã: “Noi avem unã lege sh-dupã legea a noastrã prindi s-moarã, cã s-acljimã Hiljilu a Dumnidzãlui.” <verse eid="JHN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Cãndu Pilatul avdzã aesti zboari, s-aspãrã sh-ma multu, <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />intrã iarã tu pretorium sh-lji dzãsi al Isus, “Di iu eshti tini?” Ma Isusul nu lj-apãndisi. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Atumtsea Pilatul lji dzãsi: “A njia nu nji apãndiseshti? Nu shtii tini cã mini am puteari s-ti sãlãghescu shi s-ti crutsisescu?” <verse eid="JHN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Isusul lj-apãndisi: “Tini nu va s-aveai vãrã puteari pristi mini, ma s-nu ts-eara datã di nsus. Trã atsea atsel tsi mi prideadi la tini ari ma mari amãrtii.” <verse eid="JHN 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Di atumtsea Pilatul cãfta s-lu sãlãgheascã, ma mãrlji a Iudeilor aurla dzãcãnda: “Ma sãlãghish aestu, nu eshti ma oaspili a Cesarului. Caitsido tsi s-fatsi amirã si ncuntreadzã a Cesarului.” <verse eid="JHN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Pilatul cãndu avdzã aesti zboari, lu adusi Isusul nafoarã shi s-apunã pri thronul a giudicatãljei, tu loclu cai s-acljima “Cãldãrimi” (sh-tu uvreieshti “Gabbatha”). <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Eara dzua a etimãsiriljei di Pashtili, anvãrliga di njeadzã-dzuã, sh-Pilatul lã dzãsi a Iudeilor: “Ia, amirãlu a vostru!” <verse eid="JHN 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Ma elji aurlarã: “Ljea-lu, ljea-lu! Crutsisea-lu!” Pilatul lã dzãsi a-lor: “S-lu crutsisescu amirãlu a vostru?” Arhipreftsãlji apãndisirã: “Noi nu avem altu amirã dicãt mash Cesarlu!” <verse eid="JHN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Atumtsea Pilatul lu deadi tra s-lu crutsisea. Ashãtsi loarã Isusul sh-lu dusirã nclo.<verse eid="JHN 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Crutsisirea al Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Sh-elu, tsãnãnda crutsea a lui, ishi tu loclu tsi s-acljima “Cãpãtsãnã” (tsi tu uvreieshti s-acljeamã “Golgota”). <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Aclo lu crutsisirã deadun cu doi altsã, un di unã parti sh-alantu di alantã parti sh-Isusul tu mesi. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Pilatul avea scriatã un titlu shi l-bãgã pri crutsi. Aclo eara scriatã: “ISUS NAZAREANLU, AMIRÃLU A IUDEILOR!” <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Ashãtsi aestu titlu lu cãntarã multsã di Iudei, cã loclu iu s-crutsisi Isusul eara aproapi di cãsãbã sh-titlu eara scriatã pri uvreieshti, latineshti sh-gãrtseshti. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Atumtsea, arhipreftsãlji a Iudeilor lji dzãsirã al Pilat, “Nu scrii, ‘Amirãlu a Iudeilor,’ ma, ‘Elu dzãsi, Mini escu amirãlu a Iudeilor.’” <verse eid="JHN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Pilatul apãndisi, “Atsea tsi am scriat, u am scriat.” <verse eid="JHN 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Shi suldatslji, dupã tsi lu crutsisirã, lji loarã stranjili a lui, sh-li mpãrtsarã pi patru pãrtsã, unã parti trã cathiun suldat. Elji tora loarã tunica tsi eara tutã tsãsutã di nsus pãnã nghios. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Trã atsea dzãsirã cu un-alantu: “S-nu u-arupem, ma s-arcãm soartea s-videm a cui va lji hibã.” Ashãtsi va si mplinea Scritura tsi dzãtsi: “Li mpãrtsarã ntrã elji stranjili a meali sh-arcarã soarti di tunica a mea.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Ps 22:18</ref>.</char></note> Suldatslji ashã li featsirã aesti lucri. <verse eid="JHN 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Ma ningã crutsea al Isus stãtea muma a lui sh-sora a mumãljei a lui, Maria al Cleopa, sh-Maria Magdalena. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Isusul cãndu vidzu muma a lui shi ningã nãsã uceniclu tsi vrea, lji dzãsi a mumãljei, “Muljeari, ia, hiljilu a tãu!” <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Deapoea lji dzãsi a uceniclui: “Ia, muma a ta!” Sh-di atsea oarã uceniclu u lo Maria la casa a lui.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Murirea al Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Dupã aestã, Isusul, shtinda cã tora tuti eara adrati tra si mplineascã Scritura, dzãsi, “Am seati.” <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Aclo eara un vas mplin cu puscã. Suldatslji muljarã un sfungu cu puscã sh-lu bãgarã pri unã degã di hisopi shi lji-lu apruchearã la gurã. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Ma cãndu Isusul lo pusca, dzãsi: “S-featsi!” Sh-aplicãnda caplu, deadi suflitlu. <verse eid="JHN 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Metsi eara dzua a Etimãsiriljei, tsi trupurili s-nu armãnea pri crutsi Sãmbãta, cã atsea Sãmbãtã eara unã dzuã mari shi sãmtã, Iudeilji lji cãftarã al Pilat tsi atsilor s-lã frãndzea cicioarili shi s-lji dipuna dit crutsi. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Atumtsea vinirã suldatslji shi lji li frãmsirã cicioarili a protlui shi alãntui tsi eara crutsisit cu nãsu. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Cãndu vinirã la Isusul, sh-cum vidzurã cã elu tora avea murit, nu lji li frãmsirã cicioarili, <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />ma un di suldatslji lji-u tsãpã coasta cu un gilit shi trãoarã lj-ishi sãndzi sh-apã. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Sh-atsel tsi ari vidzut, ari mãrtirsit trã aestã sh-mãrtiria a lui easti alihioasã. Elu u shtii cã dzãtsi alihea, tsi voi tutashã s-pistipsist. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Aesti lucri undzirã tra si mplineascã Scritura, “Nu va lji si frãngã nitsiun os.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:46">Ex 12:46</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 9:12">Num 9:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:20">Ps 34:20</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Sh-unã altã Scriturã dzãtsi, “Va s-veadã atsel tsi au tsãpatã.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Zac 12:10</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngruparea al Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Dupã aesti, Iosiful di Arimatea, tsi eara uceniclu al Isus, ma pri ascumtu di frica a Iudeilor, lji cãftã al Pilat s-loa truplu al Isus sh-Pilatul lji deadi volje. Atumtsea elu vini sh-lo truplu al Isus. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Ma vini sh-Nicodemul, tsi ma nãinti eara la Isusul noaptea, sh-adusi unã misticãturã di smirnã sh-aloe, aproapi treidzãtsi di kilogram. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Elji loarã truplu al Isus, sh-lu anvãrtirã cu pãndzã di ljin njurizmatã, dupã cum eara adetea a Iudeilor ti ngrupari. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Tu loclu iu elu s-crutsisi eara unã gãrdinã, sh-tu gãrdinã un murmintu nou, tu cai ninga nu eara bãgatã vãrã om. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Metsi eara dzua a Etimãsiriljei a Iudeilor, Isusul lu bãgarã aclo, cã murmintul eara aproapi.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s1">Murmintul Gol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Tu prota dzuã a stãmãnãljei, dimineatsa cãndu ninga nu avea apirit, Maria Magdalena vini la murmintu sh-vidzu cheatra mutatã di la murmintu. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Atumtsea ea s-dusi trãoarã la Simon Petrul sh-la alantu ucenic, tsi Isusul lu vrea sh-lã dzãsi a lor, “Lu au loat Domnul dit murmintu sh-nu shtim iu l-bãgarã!” <verse eid="JHN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Atumtsea Petrul sh-alantu ucenic ishirã afoarã shi s-dusirã la murmintu. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Alãga doilji deadun, ma-alantu ucenic tricu ma nãinti dicãt Petrul sh-agiumsi protlu la murmintu. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Elu s-aplicã sh-vidzu pãndzãli di ljin mpadi, ma nu intrã aclo. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Agiumsi sh-Simon Petrul, tsi l-urma, intrã tu murmintu sh-vidzu pãndzãli di ljin teasi mpadi, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />shi mãndila, tsi eara pri caplu a Isusului, tsi nu eara deadun cu pãndzãli di ljin ma eara anvãrtitã tu un singur loc. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Atumtsea intrã sh-alantu ucenic tsi avea vinit protlu la murmintu, vidzu sh-pistipsi. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Elji nu avea aduchitã ninga Scritura, cã elu prindea s-nyeadzã dit mortsã. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Deapoea ucenitsilji s-turnarã nãpoi tu casa a lor.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isus s-Aspusi la Maria Magdalena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Maria stãtea nafoarã ningã murmintu sh-plãndzea. Plãngãnda s-aplicã cãtrã murmintu, <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />sh-vidzu doi anghilji, nviscuts cu alghi, shãdzãnda unlu la cap sh-alantu la cicioari, iu eara ma nãinti truplu al Isus. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Elji lji dzãsirã: “Muljeari, cãtse plãndzã?” Ea lã dzãsi a-lor, “Cã au loatã Domnul a meu, sh-nu shtiu iu lu au bãgatã.” <verse eid="JHN 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Cum dzãsi aesti, ea s-turnã nãpoi sh-vidzu Isusul, tsi stãtea mprostu, ma nu shtia cã eara Isusul. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Isusul lji dzãsi: “Muljeari, cãtse plãndzã? Cai caftsã?” Ea minduinda cã eara gãrdinarlu, dzãsi: “Doamne, macã lu ai mutat tini, dzã-nji iu lu bãgashi, sh-mini va lu ljeau.” <verse eid="JHN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Isusul lji dzãsi, “Marie!” Ea s-turnã sh-lji dzãsi tu uvreieshti, “Rabboni!” (tsi va s-dzãcã nvitsãtore). <verse eid="JHN 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Isusul lji dzãsi: “Nu mi pusputea, cã ninga nu mi am alinatã la Tatãl a meu, ma duti la fratslji a melji sh-dzã-lã cã mini ma mi alin la Tatãl a meu, sh-la Tatãl a vostru, la Dumnidzãlu a meu sh-la Dumnidzãlu a vostru.” <verse eid="JHN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Atumtsea Maria Magdalena s-dusi sh-hãbãrsi ucenitsilji cã avea vidzut Domnul, sh-lã dzãsi a lor cã elu dzãsi aesti zboari. <verse eid="JHN 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Deapoea tu seara a dzuãljei atsiljei, tsi eara prota a stãmãnãljei, sh-cara ushili a loclui iu eara adunats ucenitsilji, eara ncljisi cã avea fricã di mãrlji a Iudeilor. Isusul vini, stãtu tu mesea a lor sh-lã-dzãsi, “Pacea cu voi!” <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Sh-cum lã dzãsi aesti, lã spusi a lor mãnjili sh-coasta. Ucenitsilji cãndu vidzurã Domnul, s-hãrsirã multu. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Deapoea Isusul lã dzãsi a-lor nãpoi, “Pacea cu voi! Ashã cum mi ari pitricut mini Tatãl, ashã mini ma vã pitrec voi.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Dupã tsi dzãsi aesti, suflã pristi nãshi sh-lã dzãsi, “Loats Duhlu Sãmtu! <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Atsilor tsi va lã li ljirtats amãrtiili, va lã hibã ljirtati, a cui va lã li tsãnets amãrtiili, atsilui va lã hibã tsinuti.”<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul s-Aspusi al Toma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Toma, (acljimat Dzeamin), un di doisprãdzatslji, nu eara cu elji cãndu vini Isusul. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Alantsã ucenitsi lji dzãsirã: “Avem vidzut Domnul!” Iarã elu lã dzãsi a lor: “Ma nu vidzui tu mãnjili a lui seamnili a penjurilor, sh-ma nu bãgai dzeaditlu a meu tu seamnili a penjurilor, sh-ma nu bãgai mãna a mea tu coastea a lui, mini nu va pistipsescu!” <verse eid="JHN 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Optu dzãli ma napoi, ucenitsilji a lui eara nãpoi nãuntru sh-Toma eara cu elji. Isusul vini cu tutã cã ushili eara ncljisi, stãtu tu mesi sh-dzãsi: “Pacea cu voi!” <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Atumtsea lji-dzãsi al Toma: “Bagã dzeaditlu a tãu aoa, sh-vedz mãnjili a meali. Tindi mãna sh-bagu tu coasta a mea shi s-nu eshti nipistimen, ma pistimen!” <verse eid="JHN 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Atumtsea Toma lji dzãsi: “Domnul sh-Dumnidzãlu a meu!” <verse eid="JHN 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Isusul lji dzãsi: “Pistipsish, cã mi vidzush, Toma. Cahara di atselji tsi nu au vidzut sh-pistipsirã!”<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nãetea al Evanghelu dupã Ioan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Isusul ari faptã sh-multi alti thavmati nãintea a ucenitsilor a lui, tsi nu suntu scriati tu cartea aestã. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Aesti suntu scriati tsi voi s-pistipsits cã Isusul easti Hristos, Hiljilu al Dumnizãlu, tsi pistipsinda s-avets banã tu numa a lui.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s1">Isusul sh-Acãtsarea Thãvmãtisitã a Peshtilor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Dupã aesti, Isusul lã si aspusi a ucenitsilor ningã amarea a Tiberiadãljei, shi undzi ashã, <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Simon Petrul, Toma (acljimat Dzeamin), Natanaelu di Cana tu Galilei, hiljilji al Zebedeu sh-doi altsã di ucenitsilji a lui eara deadun. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Simon Petrul lã-dzãsi a lor: “Ma mi duc s-piscuiescu.” Elji lji dzãsirã: “Ma yinim sh-noi cu tini.” Ishirã shi s-alinarã trãoarã tu varcã, ma atsea noapti nu acãtsarã tsiva. <verse eid="JHN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Cãndu eara dimineatsa, Isusul stãtu tu meal, ma ucenitsilji nu l-cunuscurã cã eara elu. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Atumtsea Isusul lã dzãsi: “Ficiori, nacã avets acãtsat tsiva ti mãcari?” Elji apãndisirã: “Nu!” <verse eid="JHN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Elu lã dzãsi a lor: “Arucats plasa tu parta atsea ndreapta a varcãljei sh-va aflats.” Elji arcarã plasa sh-nu putea s-u astrãdzea di multsã peshti. <verse eid="JHN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Atumtsea uceniclu tsi Isusul lu vrea lji dzãsi a Petrului: “Easti Domnul!” Simon Petrul, cãndu avdzã cã eara Domnul, nviscu stranjili cã eara dizviscut shi s-arcã tu apã. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Iarã alantsã ucenitsi vinirã cu varcã, cã nu eara diparti di meal, aproapi doausuti di cots, trãgãnda plasa cu multsã peshti. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Cãndu ishirã tu meal, vidzurã un foc cu jãr sh-pri nãsu eara bãgat peshti sh-pãni. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Isusul lã dzãsi a lor: “Adutsets di peshtilji tsi acãtsat tora!” <verse eid="JHN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Simon Petrul s-alinã tu varcã shi scoasi plasa tu meal mplinã cu peshti mãri, unã sutã tsindzãtsi shi trei. Sh-cu tutã cã eara ahãntsã multsã, plasa nu s-arupsi. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Isusul lã dzãsi a lor: “Yinits s-mãcats!” Sh-vãrã di ucenitsilji nu cutidza s-lu ntriba: “Cai eshti tini?”, shtinda cã eara Domnul. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Atumtsea Isusul vini, lo pãnea shi lã-u deadi a lor, tutashãtsi sh-pescul. <verse eid="JHN 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Aestã eara a treia oarã tsi Isusul s-aspusi a ucenitsilor a lui, dupã tsi s-nyie dit mortsã.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Anãltsã Petrul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Dupã tsi mãcarã, Isusul lji dzãsi al Simon Petru: “Simone, hiljilu al Ioan, mi vrei tini ma multu dicãt aeshti?” Elu lj-dzãsi: “Ie, Doamne, tini shtii cã mini ti voi.” Lji dzãsi napoi: “Pashti-li njeljilji a melji!” <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Isusul ntribã di a doaua oarã: “Simone, hiljilu al Ioan, mi vrei tini?” Elu lj-dzãsi, “Ie, tini shtii cã ti voi.” Isusul lji dzãsi: “Veaglji-li oili a meali!” <verse eid="JHN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Lu ntribã di a treia oarã, “Simone, hiljilu al Ioan, mi vrei tini?” Petrul si nvirinã cã lu ntribã di a treia oarã, “Mi vrei tini?”, shi lji dzãsi, “Doamne, tini li shtii tuti. Tini shtii cã mini ti voi.” Isusul lji dzãsi: “Pashti-li oili a meali! <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Dealihea ma tsã dzãc, cãndu tini earai ma tinir, strindzeai curaua sh-imnai iu vreai, ma cãndu va s-ausheshti, va li tindzã mãnjili sh-vãrã altu va s-tsã stringã curaua sh-va ti ducã aclo iu tini nu va vreai.” <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Aesti li dzãsi, tra sã spunea cu tsi moarti Petrul va s-multumãreascã Dumnidzãlui. Sh-dupã tsi dzãsi aesti, lji dzãsi: “Urmeadzã-mi!” <verse eid="JHN 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Petrul s-turnã sh-vidzu cã yinea dupã nãsu uceniclu, tsi Isusul lu vrea. (Atsel tsi la tsinã eara ndupiratã pri cheptul al Isus shi avea dzãsã, “Doamne, cai easti atsel tsi va ti vindã?”) <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Cãndu Petrul lu vidzu, lji dzãsi al Isus: “Doamne, ma cu aestu tsi va s-fac?” <verse eid="JHN 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Isusul lji dzãsi: “Macã voi tsi elu s-armãnã yiu pãnã cãndu s-yin mini, tsi ti lipseashti tini? Tini urmeadzã-mi!” <verse eid="JHN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Atumtsea ishi zborlu namisa di fratslji cã uceniclu-atsel nu va s-moarã, ma Isusul nu lji dzãsi cã nu va s-moarã, ma: “Macã voi tsi aestu s-armãnã yiu pãnã cãndu s-yinã mini, tsi ti lipseashti tini?” <verse eid="JHN 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Aestu easti uceniclu tsi mãrtirseashti trã aesti lucri sh-tsi ari scriatã aesti lucri, sh-noi shtim cã mãrtiria a lui easti alihioasã.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Suntu sh-multi alti lucri tsi featsi Isusul, tsi ma si scria unã dupã unã, minduescu cã lumea nu va li ncãpa cãrtsili tsi va sã scria.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>